ial que facilita la creación de interfaces de usuario personalizadas","fr":"ai-elements est une bibliothèque de composants pour les applications d''intelligence artificielle qui facilite la création d''interfaces utilisateur personnalisées","de":"ai-elements ist eine Komponentenbibliothek für KI-Anwendungen, die die Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Benutzeroberflächen erleichtert","pt":"O que é ai-elements? Uma biblioteca de componentes para aplicações de IA","ru":"Что такое ai-elements? Библиотека компонентов для приложений ИИ","ar":"ما هو ai-elements؟ مكتبة مكونات لتطبيقات الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"features":{"en":["Provides pre-built components like conversations and messages","Built on top of shadcn/ui for consistent design","Supports integration with Next.js for frontend development","Compatible with FastAPI for backend development","Offers a dedicated CLI command for fast setup","Integrates via the standard shadcn/ui CLI for existing users"],"zh":["预建对话组件","预建消息组件","基于shadcn/ui的组件库","支持快速集成","支持自定义注册表","适用于AI原生应用构建"],"ja":["事前構築された会話コンポーネント","事前構築されたメッセージコンポーネント","shadcn/uiに基づいたコンポーネントライブラリ","迅速な統合をサポート","カスタムレジストリをサポート","AIエージェントの構築に適しています"],"ko":["사전 구축된 대화 컴포넌트","사전 구축된 메시지 컴포넌트","shadcn/ui를 기반으로 하는 컴포넌트 라이브러리","빠른 통합을 지원","사용자 정의 레지스트리를 지원","AI 네이티브 애플리케이션 구축에 적합합니다"],"es":["Componentes preconstruidos para conversaciones y mensajes","Registro personalizado para aplicaciones AI-native","Integración con shadcn/ui","Instalación mediante CLI","Compatibilidad con Next.js y FastAPI"],"fr":["Composants préconstruits pour les conversations et les messages","Registre personnalisé pour les applications AI-native","Intégration avec shadcn/ui","Installation via CLI","Compatibilité avec Next.js et FastAPI"],"de":["Vorgefertigte Komponenten für Konversationen und Nachrichten","Benutzerdefiniertes Registry für AI-native-Anwendungen","Integration mit shadcn/ui","Installation über CLI","Kompatibilität mit Next.js und FastAPI"],"pt":["Componentes pré-construídos para conversas e mensagens","Integração com Next.js e FastAPI","Registro personalizado para aplicações de IA","Instalação rápida via CLI","Compatibilidade com shadcn/ui"],"ru":["Предварительно построенные компоненты для разговоров и сообщений","Интеграция с Next.js и FastAPI","Собственный реестр для приложений ИИ","Быстрая установка через CLI","Совместимость с shadcn/ui"],"ar":["مكونات تم بناؤها مسبقًا للمحادثات والرسائل","التكامل مع Next.js و FastAPI","سجل مخصص لتطبيقات الذكاء الاصطناعي","التثبيت السريع عبر CLI","التوافق مع shadcn/ui"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use ai-elements","ai-elements setup guide","ai-elements alternative","ai-elements vs shadcn/ui","ai-elements install","what is ai-elements","ai-elements and Next.js","ai-elements with FastAPI","ai-elements component library","ai-elements custom registry"],"zh":["AI元素","AI原生应用","shadcn/ui","组件库","自定义注册表","快速集成","AI应用构建","AI开发工具","AIエージェント"],"ja":["AIエージェント","AI Elements","shadcn/ui","コンポーネントライブラリ","カスタムレジストリ","迅速な統合","AIアプリ構築","AI開発ツール","AIエージェント構築"],"ko":["AI 요소","AI 네이티브 애플리케이션","shadcn/ui","컴포넌트 라이브러리","사용자 정의 레지스트리","빠른 통합","AI 애플리케이션 구축","AI 개발 도구","AI 에이전트 구축"],"es":["ai-elements","aplicaciones de inteligencia artificial","biblioteca de componentes","registro personalizado","shadcn/ui","Next.js","FastAPI","CLI","interfaces de usuario personalizadas"],"fr":["ai-elements","outils d''intelligence artificielle","bibliothèque de composants","registre personnalisé","shadcn/ui","Next.js","FastAPI","CLI","interfaces utilisateur personnalisées"],"de":["ai-elements","KI-Anwendungen","Komponentenbibliothek","benutzerdefiniertes Registry","shadcn/ui","Next.js","FastAPI","CLI","benutzerdefinierte Benutzeroberflächen"],"pt":["ai-elements","desenvolvimento de aplicações de IA","Next.js","FastAPI","biblioteca de componentes","registro personalizado","CLI","shadcn/ui"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","ai-elements","разработка приложений ИИ","Next.js","FastAPI","библиотека компонентов","собственный реестр","CLI","shadcn/ui"],"ar":["وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","ai-elements","تطوير تطبيقات الذكاء الاصطناعي","Next.js","FastAPI","مكتبة مكونات","سجل مخصص","CLI","shadcn/ui"]}},"owner":"OctavianTocan","repo":"ai-nexus","repoPath":"OctavianTocan/ai-nexus","stars":2,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T15:55:40Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ai-elements","description":"Create new AI chat interface components for the ai-elements library following established composable patterns, shadcn/ui integration, and Vercel AI SDK conventions. Use when creating new components in packages/elements/src or when the user asks to add a new component to ai-elements.","bodyPreview":"# AI Elements\n\n[AI Elements](https://www.npmjs.com/package/ai-elements) is a component library and custom registry built on top of [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/) to help you build AI-native applications faster. It provides pre-built components like conversations, messages and more.\n\nInstalling AI Elements is straightforward and can be done in a couple of ways. You can use the dedicated CLI command for the fastest setup, or integrate via the standard shadcn/ui CLI if you''ve already adopted s","body":"# AI Elements\n\n[AI Elements](https://www.npmjs.com/package/ai-elements) is a component library and custom registry built on top of [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/) to help you build AI-native applications faster. It provides pre-built components like conversations, messages and more.\n\nInstalling AI Elements is straightforward and can be done in a couple of ways. You can use the dedicated CLI command for the fastest setup, or integrate via the standard shadcn/ui CLI if you''ve already adopted shadcn''s workflow.\n\n\n\n## Quick Start\n\nHere are some basic examples of what you can achieve using components from AI Elements.\n\n\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore installing AI Elements, make sure your environment meets the following requirements:\n\n- [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/en/download/), version 18 or later\n- A [Next.js](https://nextjs.org/) project with the [AI SDK](https://ai-sdk.dev/) installed.\n- [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/) installed in your project. If you don''t have it installed, running any install command will automatically install it for you.\n- We also highly recommend using the [AI Gateway](https://vercel.com/docs/ai-gateway) and adding `AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY` to your `env.local` so you don''t have to use an API key from every provider. AI Gateway also gives $5 in usage per month so you can experiment with models. You can obtain an API key [here](https://vercel.com/d?to=%2F%5Bteam%5D%2F%7E%2Fai%2Fapi-keys&title=Get%20your%20AI%20Gateway%20key).\n\n\n\n## Installing Components\n\nYou can install AI Elements components using either the AI Elements CLI or the shadcn/ui CLI. Both achieve the same result: adding the selected component’s code and any needed dependencies to your project.\n\nThe CLI will download the component’s code and integrate it into your project’s directory (usually under your components folder). By default, AI Elements components are added to the `@/components/ai-elements/` directory (or whatever folder you’ve configured in your shadcn components settings).\n\nAfter running the command, you should see a confirmation in your terminal that the files were added. You can then proceed to use the component in your code.\n\n## Usage\n\nOnce an AI Elements component is installed, you can import it and use it in your application like any other React component. The components are added as part of your codebase (not hidden in a library), so the usage feels very natural.\n\n## Example\n\nAfter installing AI Elements components, you can use them in your application like any other React component. For example:\n\n```tsx title=\"conversation.tsx\"\n\"use client\";\n\nimport {\n  Message,\n  MessageContent,\n  MessageResponse,\n} from \"@/components/ai-elements/message\";\nimport { useChat } from \"@ai-sdk/react\";\n\nconst Example = () => {\n  const { messages } = useChat();\n\n  return (\n    <>\n      {messages.map(({ role, parts }, index) => (\n        <Message from={role} key={index}>\n          <MessageContent>\n            {parts.map((part, i) => {\n              switch (part.type) {\n                case \"text\":\n                  return (\n                    <MessageResponse key={`${role}-${i}`}>\n                      {part.text}\n                    </MessageResponse>\n                  );\n              }\n            })}\n          </MessageContent>\n        </Message>\n      ))}\n    </>\n  );\n};\n\nexport default Example;\n```\n\nIn the example above, we import the `Message` component from our AI Elements directory and include it in our JSX. Then, we compose the component with the `MessageContent` and `MessageResponse` subcomponents. You can style or configure the component just as you would if you wrote it yourself – since the code lives in your project, you can even open the component file to see how it works or make custom modifications.\n\n## Extensibility\n\nAll AI Elements components take as many primitive attributes as possible. For example, the `Message` component extends `HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>`, so you can pass any props that a `div` supports. This makes it easy to extend the component with your own styles or functionality.\n\n## Customization\n\n\n\nAfter installation, no additional setup is needed. The component’s styles (Tailwind CSS classes) and scripts are already integrated. You can start interacting with the component in your app immediately.\n\nFor example, if you''d like to remove the rounding on `Message`, you can go to `components/ai-elements/message.tsx` and remove `rounded-lg` as follows:\n\n```tsx title=\"components/ai-elements/message.tsx\" highlight=\"8\"\nexport const MessageContent = ({\n  children,\n  className,\n  ...props\n}: MessageContentProps) => (\n  <div\n    className={cn(\n      \"flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm text-foreground\",\n      \"group-[.is-user]:bg-primary group-[.is-user]:text-primary-foreground group-[.is-user]:px-4 group-[.is-user]:py-3\",\n      className\n    )}\n    {...props}\n  >\n    <div className=\"is-user:dark\">{children}</div>\n  </div>\n);\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n## Why are my components not styled?\n\nMake sure your project is configured correctly for shadcn/ui in Tailwind 4 - this means having a `globals.css` file that imports Tailwind and includes the shadcn/ui base styles.\n\n## I ran the AI Elements CLI but nothing was added to my project\n\nDouble-check that:\n\n- Your current working directory is the root of your project (where `package.json` lives).\n- Your components.json file (if using shadcn-style config) is set up correctly.\n- You’re using the latest version of the AI Elements CLI:\n\n```bash title=\"Terminal\"\nnpx ai-elements@latest\n```\n\nIf all else fails, feel free to open an [issue on GitHub](https://github.com/vercel/ai-elements/issues).\n\n## Theme switching doesn’t work — my app stays in light mode\n\nEnsure your app is using the same data-theme system that shadcn/ui and AI Elements expect. The default implementation toggles a data-theme attribute on the `<html>` element. Make sure your tailwind.config.js is using class or data- selectors accordingly:\n\n## The component imports fail with “module not found”\n\nCheck the file exists. If it does, make sure your `tsconfig.json` has a proper paths alias for `@/` i.e.\n\n```json title=\"tsconfig.json\"\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"baseUrl\": \".\",\n    \"paths\": {\n      \"@/*\": [\"./*\"]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## My AI coding assistant can''t access AI Elements components\n\n1. Verify your config file syntax is valid JSON.\n2. Check that the file path is correct for your AI tool.\n3. Restart your coding assistant after making changes.\n4. Ensure you have a stable internet connection.\n\n## Still stuck?\n\nIf none of these answers help, open an [issue on GitHub](https://github.com/vercel/ai-elements/issues) and someone will be happy to assist.\n\n## Available Components\n\nSee the `references/` folder for detailed documentation on each component.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T13:07:13.892Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing pre-built conversation and message components for AI-native applications","zh":"非常适合需要预建会话和消息组件的前端AI代理的AI本地应用","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが事前に構築された会話とメッセージコンポーネントを必要とするAIネイティブアプリケーションに最適","ko":"프런트엔드 에이전트가事前に구축된 대화 및 메시지 구성 요소를 필요한 AI 네이티브 응용 프로그램에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan componentes de conversación y mensaje preconstruidos para aplicaciones nativas de IA","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de composants de conversation et de message préconstruits pour les applications natives IA","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die vorgefertigte Konversations- und Nachrichtenkomponenten für IA-native Anwendungen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de componentes de conversa e mensagem pré-construídos para aplicações nativas de IA","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы предварительно построенные компоненты разговора и сообщений для приложений, родных для ИИ","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الواجهة الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى مكونات محادثة ورسالة مسبقة البناء للتطبيقات الأصلية للذكاء الاصطناعي"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build AI-native applications faster with pre-built components like conversations and messages, integrating seamlessly with Next.js and FastAPI, and leveraging the shadcn/ui library","zh":"赋予代理构建AI本地应用的能力，使用Next.js和FastAPI进行无缝集成，并利用shadcn/ui库，能够更快地构建AI本地应用","ja":"エージェントはNext.jsとFastAPIを使用してシームレスに統合し、shadcn/uiライブラリを利用して、AIネイティブアプリケーションをより迅速に構築できる","ko":"에이전트가 Next.js와 FastAPI를 사용하여 무결점으로 통합하고, shadcn/ui 라이브러리를 활용하여 AI 네이티브 애플리케이션을 더 빠르게 구축할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir aplicaciones nativas de IA más rápido con componentes preconstruidos como conversaciones y mensajes, integrándose de manera transparente con Next.js y FastAPI, y aprovechando la biblioteca shadcn/ui","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire des applications natives IA plus rapidement avec des composants préconstruits tels que des conversations et des messages, s''intégrant sans problème avec Next.js et FastAPI, et exploitant la bibliothèque shadcn/ui","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, IA-native Anwendungen mit vorgefertigten Komponenten wie Konversationen und Nachrichten schneller zu erstellen, indem es nahtlos in Next.js und FastAPI integriert und die shadcn/ui-Bibliothek nutzt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicações nativas de IA mais rapidamente com componentes pré-construídos, como conversas e mensagens, integrando-se perfeitamente com Next.js e FastAPI, e aproveitando a biblioteca shadcn/ui","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать приложения, родные для ИИ, быстрее с помощью предварительно построенных компонентов, таких как разговоры и сообщения, интегрируясь без проблем с Next.js и FastAPI, а также используя библиотеку shadcn/ui","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على بناء تطبيقات الذكاء الاصطناعي الأصلية بشكل أسرع باستخدام المكونات المسبقة البناء مثل المحادثات والرسائل، والاندماج دون مشاكل مع Next.js و FastAPI، والاستفادة من مكتبة shadcn/ui"},"useCases":{"en":["Building conversational interfaces with pre-built components","Integrating AI-powered messaging systems into existing applications","Accelerating development of AI-native applications with Next.js and FastAPI"],"zh":["使用预建组件构建对话式接口","将AI驱动的消息系统集成到现有应用中","使用Next.js和FastAPI加速AI本地应用的开发"],"ja":["事前に構築されたコンポーネントを使用して対話型インターフェイスを構築する","AI駆動のメッセージシステムを既存のアプリケーションに統合する","Next.jsとFastAPIを使用してAIネイティブアプリケーションの開発を加速する"],"ko":["事前に 구축된 구성 요소를 사용하여 대화형 인터페이스를 구축","AI 구동 메시지 시스템을 기존 애플리케이션에 통합","Next.js와 FastAPI를 사용하여 AI 네이티브 애플리케이션 개발을 가속화"],"es":["Construir interfaces de conversación con componentes preconstruidos","Integrar sistemas de mensajería impulsados por IA en aplicaciones existentes","Acelerar el desarrollo de aplicaciones nativas de IA con Next.js y FastAPI"],"fr":["Construire des interfaces de conversation avec des composants préconstruits","Intégrer des systèmes de messagerie alimentés par l''IA dans des applications existantes","Accélérer le développement d''applications natives IA avec Next.js et FastAPI"],"de":["Konversationsinterfaces mit vorgefertigten Komponenten erstellen","In bestehende Anwendungen integrierte KI-gesteuerte Messaging-Systeme","Mit Next.js und FastAPI die Entwicklung von IA-nativen Anwendungen beschleunigen"],"pt":["Construir interfaces de conversação com componentes pré-construídos","Integrar sistemas de mensagens alimentados por IA em aplicações existentes","Acelerar o desenvolvimento de aplicações nativas de IA com Next.js e FastAPI"],"ru":["Построение интерфейсов разговора с предварительно построенными компонентами","Интеграция систем обмена сообщениями, работающих на ИИ, в существующие приложения","Ускорение разработки приложений, родных для ИИ, с помощью Next.js и FastAPI"],"ar":["بناء واجهات المحادثة مع المكونات المسبقة البناء","دمج أنظمة الرسائل التي تعمل بالذكاء الاصطناعي في التطبيقات الحالية","تعزيز تطوير التطبيقات الأصلية للذكاء الاصطناعي باستخدام Next.js و FastAPI"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires shadcn/ui library","Limited to Next.js and FastAPI integrations"],"zh":["需要shadcn/ui库","仅限Next.js和FastAPI集成"],"ja":["shadcn/uiライブラリが必要","Next.jsとFastAPIの統合のみ"],"ko":["shadcn/ui 라이브러리가 필요","Next.js와 FastAPI 통합만"],"es":["Requiere la biblioteca shadcn/ui","Limitado a integraciones con Next.js y FastAPI"],"fr":["Nécessite la bibliothèque shadcn/ui","Limité aux intégrations avec Next.js et FastAPI"],"de":["Benötigt die shadcn/ui-Bibliothek","Begrenzt auf Next.js- und FastAPI-Integrationen"],"pt":["Exige a biblioteca shadcn/ui","Limitado às integrações com Next.js e FastAPI"],"ru":["Требует библиотеки shadcn/ui","Ограничен интеграциями с Next.js и FastAPI"],"ar":["يتطلب مكتبة shadcn/ui","محدود بالاندماج مع Next.js و FastAPI"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"7e36e211495cf1ecfa6791c1e91cc53e253375cc