lements est une bibliothèque de composants pour développer des applications d''intelligence artificielle plus rapidement","de":"ai-elements ist eine Komponentenbibliothek zum schnelleren Entwickeln von künstlicher Intelligenz-Anwendungen","pt":"O que é ai-elements? É uma biblioteca de componentes para construir aplicativos AI-nativos com componentes pré-construídos","ru":"Что такое ai-elements? Это библиотека компонентов для разработки приложений с поддержкой ИИ с предварительно построенными компонентами","ar":"ما هو ai-elements؟ هو مكتبة مكونات لبناء تطبيقات ذكية بالاعتماد على الإنسان الاصطناعي مع مكونات مبنية مسبقًا"},"features":{"en":["Provides pre-built components like conversations and messages","Built on top of shadcn/ui for seamless integration","Supports dedicated CLI command for fastest setup","Integrates via standard shadcn/ui CLI for existing users","Offers a custom registry for AI-native applications","Includes components for building AI-native applications faster"],"zh":["基于shadcn/ui的组件库","预构建的对话、消息等组件","支持CLI命令快速安装","兼容shadcn/ui CLI"],"ja":["shadcn/uiを基盤としたコンポーネントライブラリ","事前に構築されたコンポーネント（対話、メッセージなど）","CLIコマンドによる迅速なインストール","shadcn/ui CLIとの互換性"],"ko":["shadcn/ui를 기반으로 하는 컴포넌트 라이브러리","사전 구축된 컴포넌트（대화, 메시지 등）","CLI 명령어를 통한 빠른 설치","shadcn/ui CLI와의 호환성"],"es":["Componentes preconstruidos como conversaciones y mensajes","Integración con shadcn/ui","Instalación mediante CLI","Registro personalizado","Compatibilidad con aplicaciones de inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["Composants préconstruits tels que des conversations et des messages","Intégration avec shadcn/ui","Installation via CLI","Registre personnalisé","Compatibilité avec les applications d''intelligence artificielle"],"de":["Vordefinierte Komponenten wie Konversationen und Nachrichten","Integration mit shadcn/ui","Installation über CLI","Benutzerdefinierter Register","Kompatibilität mit künstlicher Intelligenz-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Biblioteca de componentes pré-construídos para conversas e mensagens","Registro personalizado para facilitar a integração","Instalação rápida via CLI","Compatibilidade com shadcn/ui","Componentes personalizáveis para atender às necessidades específicas"],"ru":["Библиотека предварительно построенных компонентов для разговоров и сообщений","Пользовательский реестр для упрощения интеграции","Быстрая установка через CLI","Совместимость с shadcn/ui","Настраиваемые компоненты для удовлетворения конкретных потребностей"],"ar":["مكتبة مكونات مبنية مسبقًا لل محادثات والرسائل","سجل مخصص لتسهيل التكامل","تثبيت سريع عبر CLI","توافق مع shadcn/ui","مكونات قابلة للتعديل لتناسب الاحتياجات المحددة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use ai-elements","ai-elements setup guide","ai-elements alternative","ai-elements vs shadcn/ui","ai-elements install","what is ai-elements","ai-elements documentation","ai-elements tutorial","ai-elements integration"],"zh":["AI元素","AI原生应用","组件库","自定义注册表","shadcn/ui","CLI命令","快速安装","AI开发工具"],"ja":["AIエージェント","AI Elements","コンポーネントライブラリ","カスタムレジストリ","shadcn/ui","CLIコマンド","迅速なインストール","AI開発ツール"],"ko":["AI 요소","AI 네이티브 애플리케이션","컴포넌트 라이브러리","커스텀 레지스트리","shadcn/ui","CLI 명령어","빠른 설치","AI 개발 도구"],"es":["ai-elements","desarrollo de aplicaciones de inteligencia artificial","biblioteca de componentes","shadcn/ui","CLI","registros personalizados","herramientas de inteligencia artificial","desarrollo de software","tecnologías de inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["ai-elements","développement d''applications d''intelligence artificielle","bibliothèque de composants","shadcn/ui","CLI","registres personnalisés","outils d''intelligence artificielle","développement de logiciels","technologies d''intelligence artificielle"],"de":["ai-elements","Entwicklung von künstlicher Intelligenz-Anwendungen","Komponentenbibliothek","shadcn/ui","CLI","benutzerdefinierter Register","Werkzeuge für künstliche Intelligenz","Software-Entwicklung","Technologien für künstliche Intelligenz"],"pt":["ai-elements","biblioteca de componentes","aplicativos AI-nativos","shadcn/ui","CLI","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","tecnologias de IA"],"ru":["ai-elements","библиотека компонентов","приложения с поддержкой ИИ","shadcn/ui","CLI","разработка приложений","инструменты разработки","технологии ИИ"],"ar":["ai-elements","مكتبة مكونات","تطبيقات ذكية بالاعتماد على الإنسان الاصطناعي","shadcn/ui","CLI","تطوير تطبيقات","أدوات تطوير","تقنيات الإنسان الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"crafter-station","repo":"cs.chat","repoPath":"crafter-station/cs.chat","stars":2,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-07T18:21:19Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ai-elements","description":"Create new AI chat interface components for the ai-elements library following established composable patterns, shadcn/ui integration, and Vercel AI SDK conventions. Use when creating new components in packages/elements/src or when the user asks to add a new component to ai-elements.","bodyPreview":"# AI Elements\n\n[AI Elements](https://www.npmjs.com/package/ai-elements) is a component library and custom registry built on top of [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/) to help you build AI-native applications faster. It provides pre-built components like conversations, messages and more.\n\nInstalling AI Elements is straightforward and can be done in a couple of ways. You can use the dedicated CLI command for the fastest setup, or integrate via the standard shadcn/ui CLI if you''ve already adopted s","body":"# AI Elements\n\n[AI Elements](https://www.npmjs.com/package/ai-elements) is a component library and custom registry built on top of [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/) to help you build AI-native applications faster. It provides pre-built components like conversations, messages and more.\n\nInstalling AI Elements is straightforward and can be done in a couple of ways. You can use the dedicated CLI command for the fastest setup, or integrate via the standard shadcn/ui CLI if you''ve already adopted shadcn''s workflow.\n\n\n\n## Quick Start\n\nHere are some basic examples of what you can achieve using components from AI Elements.\n\n\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore installing AI Elements, make sure your environment meets the following requirements:\n\n- [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/en/download/), version 18 or later\n- A [Next.js](https://nextjs.org/) project with the [AI SDK](https://ai-sdk.dev/) installed.\n- [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/) installed in your project. If you don''t have it installed, running any install command will automatically install it for you.\n- We also highly recommend using the [AI Gateway](https://vercel.com/docs/ai-gateway) and adding `AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY` to your `env.local` so you don''t have to use an API key from every provider. AI Gateway also gives $5 in usage per month so you can experiment with models. You can obtain an API key [here](https://vercel.com/d?to=%2F%5Bteam%5D%2F%7E%2Fai%2Fapi-keys&title=Get%20your%20AI%20Gateway%20key).\n\n\n\n## Installing Components\n\nYou can install AI Elements components using either the AI Elements CLI or the shadcn/ui CLI. Both achieve the same result: adding the selected component’s code and any needed dependencies to your project.\n\nThe CLI will download the component’s code and integrate it into your project’s directory (usually under your components folder). By default, AI Elements components are added to the `@/components/ai-elements/` directory (or whatever folder you’ve configured in your shadcn components settings).\n\nAfter running the command, you should see a confirmation in your terminal that the files were added. You can then proceed to use the component in your code.\n\n## Usage\n\nOnce an AI Elements component is installed, you can import it and use it in your application like any other React component. The components are added as part of your codebase (not hidden in a library), so the usage feels very natural.\n\n## Example\n\nAfter installing AI Elements components, you can use them in your application like any other React component. For example:\n\n```tsx title=\"conversation.tsx\"\n\"use client\";\n\nimport {\n  Message,\n  MessageContent,\n  MessageResponse,\n} from \"@/components/ai-elements/message\";\nimport { useChat } from \"@ai-sdk/react\";\n\nconst Example = () => {\n  const { messages } = useChat();\n\n  return (\n    <>\n      {messages.map(({ role, parts }, index) => (\n        <Message from={role} key={index}>\n          <MessageContent>\n            {parts.map((part, i) => {\n              switch (part.type) {\n                case \"text\":\n                  return (\n                    <MessageResponse key={`${role}-${i}`}>\n                      {part.text}\n                    </MessageResponse>\n                  );\n              }\n            })}\n          </MessageContent>\n        </Message>\n      ))}\n    </>\n  );\n};\n\nexport default Example;\n```\n\nIn the example above, we import the `Message` component from our AI Elements directory and include it in our JSX. Then, we compose the component with the `MessageContent` and `MessageResponse` subcomponents. You can style or configure the component just as you would if you wrote it yourself – since the code lives in your project, you can even open the component file to see how it works or make custom modifications.\n\n## Extensibility\n\nAll AI Elements components take as many primitive attributes as possible. For example, the `Message` component extends `HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>`, so you can pass any props that a `div` supports. This makes it easy to extend the component with your own styles or functionality.\n\n## Customization\n\n\n\nAfter installation, no additional setup is needed. The component’s styles (Tailwind CSS classes) and scripts are already integrated. You can start interacting with the component in your app immediately.\n\nFor example, if you''d like to remove the rounding on `Message`, you can go to `components/ai-elements/message.tsx` and remove `rounded-lg` as follows:\n\n```tsx title=\"components/ai-elements/message.tsx\" highlight=\"8\"\nexport const MessageContent = ({\n  children,\n  className,\n  ...props\n}: MessageContentProps) => (\n  <div\n    className={cn(\n      \"flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm text-foreground\",\n      \"group-[.is-user]:bg-primary group-[.is-user]:text-primary-foreground group-[.is-user]:px-4 group-[.is-user]:py-3\",\n      className\n    )}\n    {...props}\n  >\n    <div className=\"is-user:dark\">{children}</div>\n  </div>\n);\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n## Why are my components not styled?\n\nMake sure your project is configured correctly for shadcn/ui in Tailwind 4 - this means having a `globals.css` file that imports Tailwind and includes the shadcn/ui base styles.\n\n## I ran the AI Elements CLI but nothing was added to my project\n\nDouble-check that:\n\n- Your current working directory is the root of your project (where `package.json` lives).\n- Your components.json file (if using shadcn-style config) is set up correctly.\n- You’re using the latest version of the AI Elements CLI:\n\n```bash title=\"Terminal\"\nnpx ai-elements@latest\n```\n\nIf all else fails, feel free to open an [issue on GitHub](https://github.com/vercel/ai-elements/issues).\n\n## Theme switching doesn’t work — my app stays in light mode\n\nEnsure your app is using the same data-theme system that shadcn/ui and AI Elements expect. The default implementation toggles a data-theme attribute on the `<html>` element. Make sure your tailwind.config.js is using class or data- selectors accordingly:\n\n## The component imports fail with “module not found”\n\nCheck the file exists. If it does, make sure your `tsconfig.json` has a proper paths alias for `@/` i.e.\n\n```json title=\"tsconfig.json\"\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"baseUrl\": \".\",\n    \"paths\": {\n      \"@/*\": [\"./*\"]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## My AI coding assistant can''t access AI Elements components\n\n1. Verify your config file syntax is valid JSON.\n2. Check that the file path is correct for your AI tool.\n3. Restart your coding assistant after making changes.\n4. Ensure you have a stable internet connection.\n\n## Still stuck?\n\nIf none of these answers help, open an [issue on GitHub](https://github.com/vercel/ai-elements/issues) and someone will be happy to assist.\n\n## Available Components\n\nSee the `references/` folder for detailed documentation on each component.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T13:07:11.983Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for UI/UX Agent Developers building conversational AI interfaces with React and Next.js.","zh":"适用于使用 React 和 Next.js 构建对话式 AI 接口的 UI/UX Agent 开发人员。","ja":"React と Next.js を使用して会話型 AI インターフェイスを構築する UI/UX エージェント開発者に最適です。","ko":"React와 Next.js를 사용하여 대화형 AI 인터페이스를 구축하는 UI/UX 에이전트 개발자에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para desarrolladores de Agentes de UI/UX que construyen interfaces de AI conversacional con React y Next.js.","fr":"Idéal pour les développeurs d''Agents UI/UX qui créent des interfaces de conversation AI avec React et Next.js.","de":"Ideal für UI/UX-Agent-Entwickler, die konversationale KI-Schnittstellen mit React und Next.js erstellen.","pt":"Ideal para desenvolvedores de Agentes de UI/UX que constroem interfaces de IA conversacional com React e Next.js.","ru":"Идеально подходит для разработчиков UI/UX-агентов, создающих разговорные интерфейсы ИИ с помощью React и Next.js.","ar":"مثالي لمطوري واجهات المستخدم الخاصة بالعميل الذين يبنين واجهات الذكاء الاصطناعي المحادثية باستخدام React و Next.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Accelerates development of AI-native UIs by providing pre-built, customizable components for conversations and messages built on shadcn/ui. Integrates seamlessly with existing shadcn/ui setups through dedicated CLI tools or standard installation methods.","zh":"通过为对话和消息提供预构建、可自定义的组件（基于 shadcn/ui），加速 AI 原生 UI 的开发。通过专用 CLI 工具或标准安装方法，无缝集成到现有的 shadcn/ui 设置中。","ja":"会話とメッセージのための事前構築済みのカスタマイズ可能なコンポーネント（shadcn/ui に基づく）を提供することで、AI ネイティブ UI の開発を加速します。専用の CLI ツールまたは標準のインストール方法を使用して、既存の shadcn/ui セットアップとシームレスに統合します。","ko":"대화와 메시지에 대한 사전 구축된 사용자 지정 가능한 구성 요소(shadcn/ui 기반)를 제공하여 AI 네이티브 UI 개발을 가속화합니다. 전용 CLI 도구 또는 표준 설치 방법을 사용하여 기존의 shadcn/ui 설정과 無縫に 통합됩니다.","es":"Acelera el desarrollo de interfaces de usuario nativas de IA al proporcionar componentes personalizables y preconstruidos para conversaciones y mensajes construidos en shadcn/ui. Se integra de forma transparente con los entornos de shadcn/ui existentes a través de herramientas de línea de comandos (CLI) dedicadas o métodos de instalación estándar.","fr":"Accélère le développement d''interfaces utilisateur natives IA en fournissant des composants personnalisables et préconstruits pour les conversations et les messages construits sur shadcn/ui. S''intègre de manière transparente avec les configurations shadcn/ui existantes via des outils CLI dédiés ou des méthodes d''installation standard.","de":"Beschleunigt die Entwicklung von KI-nativen Benutzeroberflächen, indem es vorgefertigte, anpassbare Komponenten für Konversationen und Nachrichten bietet, die auf shadcn/ui basieren. Integriert sich nahtlos in bestehende shadcn/ui-Setups über dedizierte CLI-Tools oder Standard-Installationsmethoden.","pt":"Acelera o desenvolvimento de UIs nativas de IA, fornecendo componentes personalizáveis pré-construídos para conversas e mensagens construídos no shadcn/ui. Integra-se perfeitamente com configurações existentes do shadcn/ui por meio de ferramentas CLI dedicadas ou métodos de instalação padrão.","ru":"Ускоряет разработку UI, родных для ИИ, предоставляя предварительно построенные, настраиваемые компоненты для разговоров и сообщений, построенные на shadcn/ui. Интегрируется без проблем с существующими настройками shadcn/ui посредством специальных инструментов CLI или стандартных методов установки.","ar":"يسرع من تطوير واجهات المستخدم الأصلية للذكاء الاصطناعي من خلال توفير مكونات قابلة للتخصيص مسبقًا لبناء المحادثات والرسائل على شادسن/يو آي. يتكامل بشكل متماسك مع إعدادات شادسن/يو آي الحالية من خلال أدوات سطر الأوامر المخصصة أو طرق التثبيت القياسية."},"useCases":{"en":["Prototyping AI chat interfaces","Implementing conversation history components","Building message display systems","Creating customizable AI application frontends"],"zh":["原型化 AI 聊天接口","实现对话历史组件","构建消息显示系统","创建可自定义的 AI 应用程序前端"],"ja":["AI チャットインターフェイスのプロトタイピング","会話履歴コンポーネントの実装","メッセージ表示システムの構築","カスタマイズ可能な AI アプリケーションフロントエンドの作成"],"ko":["AI 채팅 인터페이스의 프로토 타입화","대화 기록 구성 요소의 구현","메시지 표시 시스템의 구축","사용자 지정 가능한 AI 애플리케이션 프론트엔드의 생성"],"es":["Crear prototipos de interfaces de chat de IA","Implementar componentes de historial de conversación","Crear sistemas de visualización de mensajes","Crear interfaces de aplicaciones de IA personalizables"],"fr":["Créer des prototypes d''interfaces de chat IA","Mettre en œuvre des composants d''historique de conversation","Construire des systèmes d''affichage de messages","Créer des interfaces d''applications IA personnalisables"],"de":["Erstellen von Prototypen für KI-Chat-Oberflächen","Implementieren von Konversationsverlaufs-Komponenten","Erstellen von Nachrichtenanzeigesystemen","Erstellen von anpassbaren KI-Anwendungs-Oberflächen"],"pt":["Prototipagem de interfaces de chat de IA","Implementação de componentes de histórico de conversa","Construção de sistemas de exibição de mensagens","Criação de interfaces de aplicativos de IA personalizáveis"],"ru":["Прототипирование интерфейсов чата ИИ","Реализация компонентов истории разговора","Построение систем отображения сообщений","Создание настраиваемых интерфейсов приложений ИИ"],"ar":["نمذجة واجهات محادثة الذكاء الاصطناعي","تنفيذ مكونات سجل المحادثة","بناء أنظمة عرض الرسائل","إنشاء واجهات تطبيقات الذكاء الاصطناعي القابلة للتخصيص"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires existing shadcn/ui setup","Limited to React/Next.js ecosystems","Dependent on npm package management"],"zh":["需要现有的 shadcn/ui 设置","仅限 React/Next.js 生态系统","依赖于 npm 包管理"],"ja":["既存の shadcn/ui セットアップが必要","React/Next.js エコシステムのみ","npm パッケージ管理に依存"],"ko":["기존의 shadcn/ui 설정이 필요","React/Next.js 생태계만","npm 패키지 관리에 의존"],"es":["Requiere una configuración existente de shadcn/ui","Limitado a los ecosistemas React/Next.js","Dependiente de la gestión de paquetes npm"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration shadcn/ui existante","Limité aux écosystèmes React/Next.js","Dépendant de la gestion de paquets npm"],"de":["Benötigt eine bestehende shadcn/ui-Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf React/Next.js-Ökosysteme","Abhängig von npm-Paketverwaltung"],"pt":["Requer configuração existente do shadcn/ui","Limitado aos ecossistemas React/Next.js","Dependente do gerenciamento de pacotes npm"],"ru":["Требует существующей настройки shadcn/ui","Ограничен экосистемами React/Next.js","Зависит от системы управления пакетами npm"],"ar":["يتطلب إعدادًا موجودًا لـ شادسن/يو آي","محدود بنظامي React/Next.js","يعتمد على إدارة الحزم npm"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"7e36e211495cf1ecfa6791c1e91cc53e253375cc5ee939d98656cc5a44d41fda","qualityScore":54}');
