o de código Rust","ru":"review-rust-all - это инструмент оркестровки SQL, который автоматизирует проверку кода Rust для ИИ Агентов","ar":"review-rust-all هو أداة تحكم SQL تutomatiza مراجعة رمز Rust للوكلاء الذكية"},"features":{"en":["Orchestrates review-rust* skills against changed files","Validates code using make ci command","Integrates with Feather-Flow schema validation framework","Supports static analysis as a first-class citizen","Works with Rust code and SQL validation"],"zh":["自动化代码审查和验证","支持SQL编排","集成Feather-Flow架构","静态分析支持","make ci验证"],"ja":["コードレビューと検証の自動化","SQLオーケストレーションのサポート","Feather-Flowアーキテクチャとの統合","静的分析のサポート","make ci検証"],"ko":["코드 리뷰와 검증 자동화","SQL 오케스트레이션 지원","Feather-Flow 아키텍처 통합","静的 분석 지원","make ci 검증"],"es":["Orquestación de SQL con review-rust*","Validación de esquemas con Feather-Flow","Análisis estático como ciudadano de primera clase","Integración con make ci","Compatibilidad con Rust"],"fr":["Orchestration SQL avec review-rust*","Validation de schémas avec Feather-Flow","Analyse statique comme citoyen de première classe","Intégration avec make ci","Compatibilité avec Rust"],"de":["SQL-Orchestrierung mit review-rust*","Schemavalidierung mit Feather-Flow","Statische Analyse als Erstklassiger","Integration mit make ci","Kompatibilität mit Rust"],"pt":["Orquestração de revisão de código Rust","Integração com o Feather-Flow para validação de esquema","Utilização de sub-habilidades para revisão de código","Validação com make ci","Suporte à análise estática","Compatibilidade com o framework de validação de esquema"],"ru":["Оркестровка проверки кода Rust","Интеграция с Feather-Flow для валидации схемы для ИИ Агентов","Использование под-навыков для проверки кода","Валидация с make ci","Поддержка статического анализа","Совместимость с фреймворком валидации схемы"],"ar":["تحكم في مراجعة رمز Rust","التكامل مع Feather-Flow لتحقق من مخطط البيانات للوكلاء الذكية","استخدام مهارات فرعية لمراجعة الرمز","التحقق مع make ci","دعم التحليل الثابت","توافق مع إطار تحقق من مخطط البيانات"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use review-rust-all","review-rust-all setup guide","review-rust-all alternative","review-rust-all vs Feather-Flow","review-rust-all install","SQL orchestration tool for Rust","Rust code review best practices"],"zh":["review-rust-all","SQL编排工具","代码审查","代码验证","Feather-Flow","静态分析","make ci"],"ja":["review-rust-all","AIエージェント","SQLオーケストレーションツール","コードレビュー","コード検証","Feather-Flow","静的分析","make ci"],"ko":["review-rust-all","AI 툴","SQL 오케스트레이션 툴","코드 리뷰","코드 검증","Feather-Flow","静的 분석","make ci"],"es":["herramientas de orquestación SQL","validación de esquemas","Feather-Flow","review-rust-all","Rust","análisis estático","make ci","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["outils d''orchestration SQL","validation de schémas","Feather-Flow","review-rust-all","Rust","analyse statique","make ci","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["SQL-Orchestrierungstools","Schemavalidierung","Feather-Flow","review-rust-all","Rust","statische Analyse","make ci","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["review-rust-all","orquestração sql","revisão de código rust","feather-flow","validação de esquema","análise estática","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","tecnologias de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["review-rust-all","оркестровка sql","проверка кода rust","feather-flow","валидация схемы","статический анализ","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","технологии разработки для ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["review-rust-all","تحكم sql","مراجعة رمز rust","feather-flow","تحقق من مخطط البيانات","تحليل ثابت","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","تقنيات التطوير للوكلاء الذكية"]}},"owner":"datastx","repo":"Feather-Flow","repoPath":"datastx/Feather-Flow","stars":1,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T00:52:40Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"review-rust-all","description":"Run all review-rust* skills as a comprehensive code review. Applies review-rust-code (best practices, type-driven design, error handling), review-rust-async-patterns (tokio concurrency, cancellation safety, channels), and review-rust-memory (allocation reduction, data layout, Feather-Flow-specific patterns). Use after completing a feature or before opening a PR.","bodyPreview":"# Comprehensive Rust Code Review\n\nOrchestrates all three `review-rust*` skills against changed files, then validates with `make ci`. This skill contains no review criteria of its own — all opinions live in the sub-skills.\n\n**Context**: Feather-Flow is a schema validation framework with static analysis as a first-class citizen. See **[HOW_FEATHERFLOW_WORKS.md](../../../HOW_FEATHERFLOW_WORKS.md)** for the full architecture. All code changes should be reviewed in the context of this goal — mandator","body":"# Comprehensive Rust Code Review\n\nOrchestrates all three `review-rust*` skills against changed files, then validates with `make ci`. This skill contains no review criteria of its own — all opinions live in the sub-skills.\n\n**Context**: Feather-Flow is a schema validation framework with static analysis as a first-class citizen. See **[HOW_FEATHERFLOW_WORKS.md](../../../HOW_FEATHERFLOW_WORKS.md)** for the full architecture. All code changes should be reviewed in the context of this goal — mandatory schemas, compile-time validation, AST-based dependency extraction, and no CTEs.\n\n## Project Layout\n\nCargo workspace with crates under `crates/`:\n\n| Crate | Path | Role |\n|-------|------|------|\n| `ff-cli` | `crates/ff-cli/` | Binary (CLI commands, integration tests) |\n| `ff-core` | `crates/ff-core/` | Library (shared types, config, DAG) |\n| `ff-analysis` | `crates/ff-analysis/` | Library (DataFusion static analysis) |\n| `ff-sql` | `crates/ff-sql/` | Library (SQL parsing, lineage) |\n| `ff-jinja` | `crates/ff-jinja/` | Library (Jinja template rendering) |\n| `ff-db` | `crates/ff-db/` | Library (database trait + DuckDB) |\n| `ff-test` | `crates/ff-test/` | Library (schema test generation) |\n\n## Procedure\n\n### Step 1: Identify changed files\n\nFind modified `.rs` files:\n\n```bash\n# If on a feature branch:\ngit diff --name-only main -- ''*.rs''\n\n# If on main with uncommitted changes:\ngit diff --name-only -- ''*.rs''\ngit diff --cached --name-only -- ''*.rs''\n\n# For the last commit:\ngit diff --name-only HEAD~1 -- ''*.rs''\n```\n\nSeparate into two groups:\n- **Production code**: files under `crates/*/src/`\n- **Test code**: files under `crates/*/tests/` or ending in `_test.rs`\n\nRead every changed file in full before reviewing.\n\n### Step 2: Apply review-rust-code\n\nRead the full skill file and apply all of its rules against every changed `.rs` file:\n\n```\nRead .claude/skills/review-rust-code/SKILL.md\n```\n\n### Step 3: Apply review-rust-async-patterns\n\nCheck if any changed files contain async code:\n\n```bash\ngrep -rl ''async\\|\\.await\\|tokio::\\|spawn'' <changed-files>\n```\n\n**Skip this step entirely if none do.**\n\nOtherwise, read the full skill file and apply all of its rules against each async file:\n\n```\nRead .claude/skills/review-rust-async-patterns/SKILL.md\n```\n\n### Step 4: Apply review-rust-memory\n\nRead the full skill file and apply all of its rules against every changed `.rs` file:\n\n```\nRead .claude/skills/review-rust-memory/SKILL.md\n```\n\n### Step 5: Report findings\n\nCombine all findings from steps 2-4 into a single report grouped by crate, then by file. Use the severity definitions from the sub-skills. Example format:\n\n```\n## ff-analysis\n\n### crates/ff-analysis/src/datafusion_bridge/provider.rs\n\n- **Error**: [description]\n- **Warning**: [description]\n\n## ff-cli\n\n### crates/ff-cli/src/commands/common.rs\n\n- **Info**: [description]\n```\n\n### Step 6: Verify\n\nRun `make ci` to confirm format, clippy, tests, and docs all pass.\n\n## Usage\n\n```\n/review-rust-all\n```\n\nOr target specific files:\n\n```\n/review-rust-all crates/ff-cli/src/commands/compile.rs crates/ff-analysis/src/datafusion_bridge/propagation.rs\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T07:13:27.841Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing comprehensive Rust code analysis and SQL validation.","zh":"非常适合需要对Rust代码进行全面分析和SQL验证的代码审查代理。","ja":"Rustコードの総合的な分析とSQLの検証が必要なコードレビュー代理に最適です。","ko":"Rust 코드의 종합적인 분석과 SQL 검증이 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan un análisis de código Rust y validación de SQL exhaustivos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de revue de code nécessitant une analyse de code Rust et une validation SQL complètes.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agents, die eine umfassende Rust-Code-Analyse und SQL-Validierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de uma análise abrangente de código Rust e validação SQL.","ru":"Идеально для агентов проверки кода, которым требуется всесторонний анализ кода на Rust и проверка SQL.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مراجعة الكود الذي يحتاج إلى تحليل شامل للكود الرستي والتحقق من SQL."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to orchestrate SQL validation and static analysis for Rust code using the Feather-Flow schema validation framework, leveraging sub-skills for in-depth review and validation with ''make ci'', ensuring high-quality code changes.","zh":"赋予代理编排SQL验证和Rust代码的静态分析能力，利用Feather-Flow模式验证框架，并利用子技能进行深入的审查和验证，使用''make ci''确保高质量的代码更改。","ja":"SQLの検証とRustコードの静的解析をオーケストレートするエージェントを可能にし、Feather-Flowスキーマ検証フレームワークを利用し、サブスキルを利用して詳細なレビューと検証を実行し、''make ci''を使用して高品質のコード変更を保証する。","ko":"에이전트가 SQL 검증 및 Rust 코드의 정적 분석을 오케스트레이션 할 수 있도록하며, Feather-Flow 스키마 검증 프레임워크를 활용하여, 하위ス킬을 사용하여 심층적인 검토 및 검증을 수행하고, ''make ci''를 사용하여 높은 품질의 코드 변경을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a orquestar la validación de SQL y el análisis estático para el código Rust utilizando el marco de validación de esquemas Feather-Flow, aprovechando sub-habilidades para una revisión y validación en profundidad con ''make ci'', garantizando cambios de código de alta calidad.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''orchestrer la validation SQL et l''analyse statique pour le code Rust en utilisant le framework de validation de schémas Feather-Flow, en exploitant les sous-compétences pour un examen et une validation en profondeur avec ''make ci'', assurant des modifications de code de haute qualité.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die SQL-Validierung und statische Analyse für Rust-Code mithilfe des Feather-Flow-Schema-Validierungsframeworks zu orchestrieren, indem es Subfähigkeiten für eine gründliche Überprüfung und Validierung mit ''make ci'' nutzt, um hochwertige Code-Änderungen sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a orquestrar a validação SQL e a análise estática para o código Rust usando o framework de validação de esquema Feather-Flow, aproveitando sub-habilidades para revisão e validação aprofundadas com ''make ci'', garantindo alterações de código de alta qualidade.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оркестрировать проверку SQL и статический анализ для кода на Rust, используя фреймворк валидации схемы Feather-Flow, используя поднавыки для глубокого обзора и проверки с помощью ''make ci'', обеспечивая высококачественные изменения кода.","ar":"يُمكّن الوكيل من تنسيق التحقق من SQL والتحليل الثابت للكود الرستي باستخدام إطار التحقق من مخطط Feather-Flow، وتحقيق مهارات فرعية لاستعراض و التحقق العميق مع ''make ci''، وضمان تغييرات عالية الجودة في الكود."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating Rust code changes against Feather-Flow schema","Performing static analysis on Rust codebases","Automating code reviews with ''make ci'' validation"],"zh":["验证Rust代码更改是否符合Feather-Flow模式","对Rust代码库执行静态分析","使用''make ci''验证自动化代码审查"],"ja":["Feather-Flowスキーマに従ったRustコードの変更の検証","Rustコードベースの静的解析の実行","''make ci''検証を使用した自動化コードレビュー"],"ko":["Feather-Flow 스키마에 따라 Rust 코드 변경 사항을 검증합니다.","Rust 코드베이스에 대한 정적 분석을 수행합니다.","''make ci'' 검증을 사용하여 코드 리뷰를 자동화합니다."],"es":["Validar cambios de código Rust contra el esquema Feather-Flow","Realizar análisis estático en bases de código Rust","Automatizar revisiones de código con validación ''make ci''"],"fr":["Valider les modifications de code Rust par rapport au schéma Feather-Flow","Effectuer une analyse statique sur les bases de code Rust","Automatiser les revues de code avec la validation ''make ci''"],"de":["Rust-Code-Änderungen gegen das Feather-Flow-Schema validieren","Statische Analyse auf Rust-Codebasen durchführen","Code-Reviews mit ''make ci''-Validierung automatisieren"],"pt":["Validar alterações de código Rust contra o esquema Feather-Flow","Realizar análise estática em bases de código Rust","Automatizar revisões de código com validação ''make ci''"],"ru":["Проверка изменений кода на Rust против схемы Feather-Flow","Выполнение статического анализа кодовых баз на Rust","Автоматизация проверок кода с помощью валидации ''make ci''"],"ar":["التحقق من تغييرات الكود الرستي مقابل مخطط Feather-Flow","إجراء تحليل ثابت للكود الرستي","توفير مراجعة الكود تلقائيًا مع التحقق من ''make ci''"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Feather-Flow schema validation framework","Limited to Rust code review","Dependent on sub-skills for review criteria"],"zh":["需要Feather-Flow模式验证框架","仅限于Rust代码审查","依赖于子技能进行审查标准"],"ja":["Feather-Flowスキーマ検証フレームワークが必要","Rustコードレビューのみに対応","レビュークリテリアのためのサブスキルに依存"],"ko":["Feather-Flow 스키마 검증 프레임워크가 필요합니다.","Rust 코드 리뷰만 해당됩니다.","검토 기준에 대한 하위 스킬에 의존합니다."],"es":["Requiere el marco de validación de esquemas Feather-Flow","Limitado a la revisión de código Rust","Dependiente de sub-habilidades para los criterios de revisión"],"fr":["Nécessite le framework de validation de schémas Feather-Flow","Limité à la revue de code Rust","Dépendant des sous-compétences pour les critères d''examen"],"de":["Benötigt das Feather-Flow-Schema-Validierungsframework","Begrenzt auf Rust-Code-Review","Abhängig von Subfähigkeiten für die Überprüfungskriterien"],"pt":["Exige o framework de validação de esquema Feather-Flow","Limitado à revisão de código Rust","Dependente de sub-habilidades para critérios de revisão"],"ru":["Требует фреймворка валидации схемы Feather-Flow","Ограничен проверкой кода на Rust","Зависит от поднавыков для критериев проверки"],"ar":["يتطلب إطار التحقق من مخطط Feather-Flow","محدود لمراجعة كود الرستي","يعتمد على مهارات فرعية لمعايير الاستعراض"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"2a1680bd75c7dd4b1af88788e2b819c6b5ee3850b58dab5c012337a7d43a1224","qualityScore":54}');
