INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('datastx/Feather-Flow/review-rust-all', 'review-rust-all', 'datastx', 'Feather-Flow', 'community', 'review-rust-all datastx Feather-Flow community The review-rust-all skill orchestrates SQL validation and static analysis for Rust code, benefiting developers working with Feather-Flow schema validation framework. review-rust-all技能是一个SQL编排工具，用于自动化代码审查和验证 review-rust-all AIエージェントは、コードレビューと検証を自動化するSQLオーケストレーションツールです review-rust-all은 코드 리뷰와 검증을 자동화하는 SQL 오케스트레이션 툴입니다 Review-rust-all es una herramienta de orquestación SQL que simplifica la validación de esquemas con Feather-Flow Review-rust-all est un outil d''orchestration SQL qui simplifie la validation de schémas avec Feather-Flow Review-rust-all ist ein SQL-Orchestrierungstool, das die Schemavalidierung mit Feather-Flow vereinfacht O review-rust-all é uma ferramenta de orquestração SQL que revisa código Rust de forma eficaz, utilizando o Feather-Flow como framework de validação de esquema. review-rust-all - это инструмент оркестровки SQL, который эффективно проверяет код Rust, используя Feather-Flow в качестве фреймворка валидации схемы для ИИ Агентов review-rust-all هو أداة تحكم SQL تقوم بمراجعة رمز Rust بفعالية، باستخدام Feather-Flow كإطار تحقق من مخطط البيانات للوكلاء الذكية how to use review-rust-all review-rust-all setup guide review-rust-all alternative review-rust-all vs Feather-Flow review-rust-all install SQL orchestration tool for Rust Rust code review best practices review-rust-all SQL编排工具 代码审查 代码验证 Feather-Flow 静态分析 make ci Orchestrates review-rust* skills against changed files Validates code using make ci command Integrates with Feather-Flow schema validation framework Supports static analysis as a first-class citizen Works with Rust code and SQL validation review-rust-all is a SQL orchestration tool that validates Rust code changes using make ci and sub-skills review-rust*');
