 build AI-native applications faster.","zh":"AI元素是一种AI Agent工具注册表，提供预建组件和自定义注册表","ja":"AI ElementsはAIエージェント用のコンポーネントライブラリとカスタムレジストリです","ko":"AI 요소는 AI 에이전트용 컴포넌트 라이브러리와 커스텀 레지스트리입니다","es":"ai-elements es un conjunto de herramientas de agente de inteligencia artificial con adaptadores para ai-sdk y tanstack-ai","fr":"ai-elements est un ensemble d''outils d''agent d''intelligence artificielle avec des adaptateurs pour ai-sdk et tanstack-ai","de":"ai-elements ist ein Satz von KI-Agent-Tools mit Adapters für ai-sdk und tanstack-ai","pt":"O que é ai-elements? É uma biblioteca de componentes para construir aplicações nativas de IA com ferramentas de agente de IA","ru":"Что такое ai-elements? Это библиотека компонентов для создания родных приложений ИИ с инструментами ИИ Агентов","ar":"ما هو ai-elements؟ هي مكتبة مكونات لإنشاء تطبيقات ذكاء اصطناعي أصلية مع أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"features":{"en":["Provides pre-built components like conversations and messages","Leverages shadcn/ui for a seamless development experience","Integrates with tanstack-ai for enhanced AI capabilities","Offers a dedicated CLI command for fast setup","Supports integration via the standard shadcn/ui CLI","Includes adapters for ai-sdk and tanstack-ai"],"zh":["预建组件，如会话和消息","支持ai-sdk和tanstack-ai","基于shadcn/ui的组件库","自定义注册表","CLI命令行工具支持"],"ja":["会話やメッセージなどのコンポーネント","ai-sdkとtanstack-aiのサポート","shadcn/uiに基づくコンポーネントライブラリ","カスタムレジストリ","CLIコマンドラインツールのサポート"],"ko":["대화, 메시지 등과 같은 컴포넌트","ai-sdk와 tanstack-ai 지원","shadcn/ui 기반의 컴포넌트 라이브러리","커스텀 레지스트리","CLI 명령어 지원"],"es":["Componentes preconstruidos para conversaciones y mensajes","Adaptadores para ai-sdk y tanstack-ai","Registro personalizado para una integración sencilla","Instalación rápida mediante CLI","Compatibilidad con shadcn/ui"],"fr":["Composants prêts à l''emploi pour les conversations et les messages","Adaptateurs pour ai-sdk et tanstack-ai","Registre personnalisé pour une intégration simple","Installation rapide via CLI","Compatibilité avec shadcn/ui"],"de":["Vorgefertigte Komponenten für Konversationen und Nachrichten","Adapters für ai-sdk und tanstack-ai","Benutzerdefinierter Register für eine einfache Integration","Schnelle Installation über CLI","Kompatibilität mit shadcn/ui"],"pt":["Biblioteca de componentes pré-construídos para aplicações de IA","Registro personalizado para ferramentas de agente de IA","Integração com shadcn/ui para construir aplicações mais rapidamente","Suporte a conversas e mensagens","Instalação fácil via CLI"],"ru":["Библиотека предустановленных компонентов для приложений ИИ","Пользовательский реестр для инструментов ИИ Агентов","Интеграция с shadcn/ui для создания приложений быстрее","Поддержка разговоров и сообщений","Легкая установка через CLI"],"ar":["مكتبة مكونات مسبقة البناء لتطبيقات الذكاء الاصطناعي","سجل مخصص لأدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","التكامل مع shadcn/ui لإنشاء تطبيقات بشكل أسرع","دعم المحادثات والرسائل","تثبيت سهل عبر CLI"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use ai-elements","ai-elements setup guide","ai-elements alternative","ai-elements vs tanstack-ai","ai-elements install","what is ai-elements","ai-elements documentation","ai-elements tutorial","ai-elements integration"],"zh":["AI元素","AI Agent工具","ai-sdk","tanstack-ai","shadcn/ui","组件库","自定义注册表","CLI命令行工具"],"ja":["AIエージェント","AI Elements","ai-sdk","tanstack-ai","shadcn/ui","コンポーネントライブラリ","カスタムレジストリ","CLIコマンドラインツール"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","AI 요소","ai-sdk","tanstack-ai","shadcn/ui","컴포넌트 라이브러리","커스텀 레지스트리","CLI 명령어"],"es":["herramientas de agente de inteligencia artificial","ai-elements","ai-sdk","tanstack-ai","desarrollo de aplicaciones de inteligencia artificial","componentes preconstruidos","adaptadores para ai-sdk","registro personalizado"],"fr":["outils d''agent d''intelligence artificielle","ai-elements","ai-sdk","tanstack-ai","création d''applications d''intelligence artificielle","composants prêts à l''emploi","adaptateurs pour ai-sdk","registre personnalisé"],"de":["KI-Agent-Tools","ai-elements","ai-sdk","tanstack-ai","Entwicklung von KI-Anwendungen","vorgefertigte Komponenten","Adapters für ai-sdk","benutzerdefinierter Register"],"pt":["ai-elements","ferramentas de agente de IA","aplicações nativas de IA","shadcn/ui","biblioteca de componentes","registro personalizado","conversas","mensagens","CLI"],"ru":["ai-elements","инструменты ИИ Агентов","родные приложения ИИ","shadcn/ui","библиотека компонентов","пользовательский реестр","разговоры","сообщения","CLI"],"ar":["ai-elements","أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطبيقات ذكاء اصطناعي أصلية","shadcn/ui","مكتبة مكونات","سجل مخصص","محادثات","رسائل","CLI"]}},"owner":"endalk200","repo":"ai-registry","repoPath":"endalk200/ai-registry","stars":1,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T06:01:11Z","topics":["agent-tools","agents","ai-sdk","ai-sdk-agents","tanstack-ai","tanstack-ai-tools","tools"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ai-elements","description":"Create new AI chat interface components for the ai-elements library following established composable patterns, shadcn/ui integration, and Vercel AI SDK conventions. Use when creating new components in packages/elements/src or when the user asks to add a new component to ai-elements.","bodyPreview":"# AI Elements\n\n[AI Elements](https://www.npmjs.com/package/ai-elements) is a component library and custom registry built on top of [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/) to help you build AI-native applications faster. It provides pre-built components like conversations, messages and more.\n\nInstalling AI Elements is straightforward and can be done in a couple of ways. You can use the dedicated CLI command for the fastest setup, or integrate via the standard shadcn/ui CLI if you''ve already adopted s","body":"# AI Elements\n\n[AI Elements](https://www.npmjs.com/package/ai-elements) is a component library and custom registry built on top of [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/) to help you build AI-native applications faster. It provides pre-built components like conversations, messages and more.\n\nInstalling AI Elements is straightforward and can be done in a couple of ways. You can use the dedicated CLI command for the fastest setup, or integrate via the standard shadcn/ui CLI if you''ve already adopted shadcn''s workflow.\n\n\n\n## Quick Start\n\nHere are some basic examples of what you can achieve using components from AI Elements.\n\n\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore installing AI Elements, make sure your environment meets the following requirements:\n\n- [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/en/download/), version 18 or later\n- A [Next.js](https://nextjs.org/) project with the [AI SDK](https://ai-sdk.dev/) installed.\n- [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/) installed in your project. If you don''t have it installed, running any install command will automatically install it for you.\n- We also highly recommend using the [AI Gateway](https://vercel.com/docs/ai-gateway) and adding `AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY` to your `env.local` so you don''t have to use an API key from every provider. AI Gateway also gives $5 in usage per month so you can experiment with models. You can obtain an API key [here](https://vercel.com/d?to=%2F%5Bteam%5D%2F%7E%2Fai%2Fapi-keys&title=Get%20your%20AI%20Gateway%20key).\n\n\n\n## Installing Components\n\nYou can install AI Elements components using either the AI Elements CLI or the shadcn/ui CLI. Both achieve the same result: adding the selected component’s code and any needed dependencies to your project.\n\nThe CLI will download the component’s code and integrate it into your project’s directory (usually under your components folder). By default, AI Elements components are added to the `@/components/ai-elements/` directory (or whatever folder you’ve configured in your shadcn components settings).\n\nAfter running the command, you should see a confirmation in your terminal that the files were added. You can then proceed to use the component in your code.\n\n## Usage\n\nOnce an AI Elements component is installed, you can import it and use it in your application like any other React component. The components are added as part of your codebase (not hidden in a library), so the usage feels very natural.\n\n## Example\n\nAfter installing AI Elements components, you can use them in your application like any other React component. For example:\n\n```tsx title=\"conversation.tsx\"\n\"use client\";\n\nimport {\n  Message,\n  MessageContent,\n  MessageResponse,\n} from \"@/components/ai-elements/message\";\nimport { useChat } from \"@ai-sdk/react\";\n\nconst Example = () => {\n  const { messages } = useChat();\n\n  return (\n    <>\n      {messages.map(({ role, parts }, index) => (\n        <Message from={role} key={index}>\n          <MessageContent>\n            {parts.map((part, i) => {\n              switch (part.type) {\n                case \"text\":\n                  return (\n                    <MessageResponse key={`${role}-${i}`}>\n                      {part.text}\n                    </MessageResponse>\n                  );\n              }\n            })}\n          </MessageContent>\n        </Message>\n      ))}\n    </>\n  );\n};\n\nexport default Example;\n```\n\nIn the example above, we import the `Message` component from our AI Elements directory and include it in our JSX. Then, we compose the component with the `MessageContent` and `MessageResponse` subcomponents. You can style or configure the component just as you would if you wrote it yourself – since the code lives in your project, you can even open the component file to see how it works or make custom modifications.\n\n## Extensibility\n\nAll AI Elements components take as many primitive attributes as possible. For example, the `Message` component extends `HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>`, so you can pass any props that a `div` supports. This makes it easy to extend the component with your own styles or functionality.\n\n## Customization\n\n\n\nAfter installation, no additional setup is needed. The component’s styles (Tailwind CSS classes) and scripts are already integrated. You can start interacting with the component in your app immediately.\n\nFor example, if you''d like to remove the rounding on `Message`, you can go to `components/ai-elements/message.tsx` and remove `rounded-lg` as follows:\n\n```tsx title=\"components/ai-elements/message.tsx\" highlight=\"8\"\nexport const MessageContent = ({\n  children,\n  className,\n  ...props\n}: MessageContentProps) => (\n  <div\n    className={cn(\n      \"flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm text-foreground\",\n      \"group-[.is-user]:bg-primary group-[.is-user]:text-primary-foreground group-[.is-user]:px-4 group-[.is-user]:py-3\",\n      className\n    )}\n    {...props}\n  >\n    <div className=\"is-user:dark\">{children}</div>\n  </div>\n);\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n## Why are my components not styled?\n\nMake sure your project is configured correctly for shadcn/ui in Tailwind 4 - this means having a `globals.css` file that imports Tailwind and includes the shadcn/ui base styles.\n\n## I ran the AI Elements CLI but nothing was added to my project\n\nDouble-check that:\n\n- Your current working directory is the root of your project (where `package.json` lives).\n- Your components.json file (if using shadcn-style config) is set up correctly.\n- You’re using the latest version of the AI Elements CLI:\n\n```bash title=\"Terminal\"\nnpx ai-elements@latest\n```\n\nIf all else fails, feel free to open an [issue on GitHub](https://github.com/vercel/ai-elements/issues).\n\n## Theme switching doesn’t work — my app stays in light mode\n\nEnsure your app is using the same data-theme system that shadcn/ui and AI Elements expect. The default implementation toggles a data-theme attribute on the `<html>` element. Make sure your tailwind.config.js is using class or data- selectors accordingly:\n\n## The component imports fail with “module not found”\n\nCheck the file exists. If it does, make sure your `tsconfig.json` has a proper paths alias for `@/` i.e.\n\n```json title=\"tsconfig.json\"\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"baseUrl\": \".\",\n    \"paths\": {\n      \"@/*\": [\"./*\"]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## My AI coding assistant can''t access AI Elements components\n\n1. Verify your config file syntax is valid JSON.\n2. Check that the file path is correct for your AI tool.\n3. Restart your coding assistant after making changes.\n4. Ensure you have a stable internet connection.\n\n## Still stuck?\n\nIf none of these answers help, open an [issue on GitHub](https://github.com/vercel/ai-elements/issues) and someone will be happy to assist.\n\n## Available Components\n\nSee the `references/` folder for detailed documentation on each component.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T01:54:31.922Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing rapid development of AI-native applications with pre-built conversation and message components.","zh":"非常适合需要快速开发AI原生应用程序的前端代理，具有预建的对话和消息组件。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントがAIネイティブアプリケーションを迅速に開発する必要がある場合は、事前構築された会話およびメッセージコンポーネントで完璧です。","ko":"프론트엔드 에이전트가 AI 네이티브 애플리케이션을 신속하게 개발해야 하는 경우에는 사전 구축된 대화 및 메시지 컴포넌트가 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan un desarrollo rápido de aplicaciones nativas de IA con componentes de conversación y mensaje preconstruidos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin d''un développement rapide d''applications natives IA avec des composants de conversation et de message prédéfinis.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine schnelle Entwicklung von AI-nativen Anwendungen mit vorgefertigten Konversations- und Nachrichtenkomponenten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de desenvolvimento rápido de aplicações nativas de IA com componentes de conversa e mensagem pré-construídos.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым требуется быстрая разработка приложений, родных для ИИ, с предварительно построенными компонентами разговора и сообщений.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذين يحتاجون إلى تطوير سريع لتطبيقات ذكية الأصل مع مكونات محادثة ورسالة مسبقة البناء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build AI-native applications faster with pre-built components like conversations and messages, leveraging shadcn/ui and tanstack-ai, and streamlines development with a custom registry.","zh":"赋予代理构建AI原生应用程序的能力，使用预建组件（如会话和消息）以及shadcn/ui和tanstack-ai，并通过自定义注册表简化开发。","ja":"エージェントが事前構築されたコンポーネント（会話やメッセージなど）を使用してAIネイティブアプリケーションを迅速に構築できるようにし、shadcn/uiおよびtanstack-aiを活用し、カスタムレジストリで開発を簡素化します。","ko":"에이전트가 사전 구축된 컴포넌트(대화 및 메시지 등)를 사용하여 AI 네이티브 애플리케이션을 신속하게 구축할 수 있도록 하며, shadcn/ui 및 tanstack-ai를 활용하고, 사용자 정의 레지스트리로 개발을 간소화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir aplicaciones nativas de IA más rápido con componentes preconstruidos como conversaciones y mensajes, aprovechando shadcn/ui y tanstack-ai, y agiliza el desarrollo con un registro personalizado.","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire des applications natives IA plus rapidement avec des composants prédéfinis tels que des conversations et des messages, en exploitant shadcn/ui et tanstack-ai, et rationalise le développement avec un registre personnalisé.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, AI-nativen Anwendungen mit vorgefertigten Komponenten wie Konversationen und Nachrichten schneller zu erstellen, indem sie shadcn/ui und tanstack-ai nutzen und die Entwicklung mit einem benutzerdefinierten Registrierungsprozess rationalisieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicações nativas de IA mais rapidamente com componentes pré-construídos, como conversas e mensagens, aproveitando shadcn/ui e tanstack-ai, e otimiza o desenvolvimento com um registro personalizado.","ru":"Позволяет агентам строить приложения, родные для ИИ, быстрее с помощью предварительно построенных компонентов, таких как разговоры и сообщения, используя shadcn/ui и tanstack-ai, и оптимизирует разработку с помощью пользовательского реестра.","ar":"تمكين العميل من بناء تطبيقات ذكية الأصل بشكل أسرع باستخدام مكونات مسبقة البناء مثل المحادثات والرسائل، والاستفادة من shadcn/ui وtanstack-ai، وتحسين التطوير باستخدام سجل مخصص."},"useCases":{"en":["Building conversational interfaces with pre-built components","Creating custom message systems for AI-native applications","Accelerating development of AI-powered chatbots"],"zh":["使用预建组件构建对话式接口","为AI原生应用程序创建自定义消息系统","加速AI驱动的聊天机器人的开发"],"ja":["事前構築されたコンポーネントを使用して対話式インターフェイスを構築する","AIネイティブアプリケーションのためのカスタムメッセージシステムを作成する","AI駆動のチャットボットの開発を加速する"],"ko":["사전 구축된 컴포넌트를 사용하여 대화형 인터페이스를 구축하는 것","AI 네이티브 애플리케이션을 위한 사용자 정의 메시지 시스템을 생성하는 것","AI 구동 채팅봇의 개발을 가속화하는 것"],"es":["Creación de interfaces de conversación con componentes preconstruidos","Creación de sistemas de mensajería personalizados para aplicaciones nativas de IA","Aceleración del desarrollo de chatbots impulsados por IA"],"fr":["Création d''interfaces de conversation avec des composants prédéfinis","Création de systèmes de messagerie personnalisés pour les applications natives IA","Accélération du développement de chatbots alimentés par IA"],"de":["Erstellung von Konversationsinterfaces mit vorgefertigten Komponenten","Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Nachrichtensystemen für AI-nativen Anwendungen","Beschleunigung der Entwicklung von künstlich intelligente Chatbots"],"pt":["Construção de interfaces de conversação com componentes pré-construídos","Criação de sistemas de mensagens personalizados para aplicações nativas de IA","Aceleração do desenvolvimento de chatbots alimentados por IA"],"ru":["Создание интерфейсов разговора с предварительно построенными компонентами","Создание пользовательских систем сообщений для приложений, родных для ИИ","Ускорение разработки чат-ботов, работающих на ИИ"],"ar":["بناء واجهات محادثة مع مكونات مسبقة البناء","إنشاء أنظمة رسائل مخصصة لتطبيقات ذكية الأصل","تعجيل تطوير المحادثات التي تعمل بالذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires shadcn/ui integration","Dependent on tanstack-ai library"],"zh":["需要shadcn/ui集成","依赖于tanstack-ai库"],"ja":["shadcn/uiの統合が必要","tanstack-aiライブラリに依存する"],"ko":["shadcn/ui 통합이 필요함","tanstack-ai 라이브러리에 의존"],"es":["Requiere integración con shadcn/ui","Dependiente de la biblioteca tanstack-ai"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec shadcn/ui","Dépend de la bibliothèque tanstack-ai"],"de":["Erfordert Integration mit shadcn/ui","Abhängig von der Bibliothek tanstack-ai"],"pt":["Requer integração com shadcn/ui","Dependente da biblioteca tanstack-ai"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с shadcn/ui","Зависит от библиотеки tanstack-ai"],"ar":["يتطلب دمجًا مع shadcn/ui","يعتمد على مكتبة tanstack-ai"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"7e36e211495cf1ecfa6791c1e91cc53e253375cc5ee939d98656cc5a44d41fda","qualityScore":54}');
