INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('aolus-software/clean-elysia-prisma/prisma-expert', 'prisma-expert', 'aolus-software', 'clean-elysia-prisma', 'community', 'prisma-expert aolus-software clean-elysia-prisma community The prisma-expert skill provides deep knowledge of Prisma ORM, benefiting developers who need expertise in schema design, migrations, and query optimization. It supports PostgreSQL, MySQL, and SQLite database operations. Prisma Expert 是一名专业的 Prisma ORM 专家，具有深厚的 schema 设计、迁移、查询优化等技术知识 Prisma Expert は Prisma ORM の専門家で、スキーマ設計、移行、クエリ最適化などの技術に深い知識を持っています Prisma Expert는 Prisma ORM 전문가로 스키마 설계, 마이그레이션, 쿼리 최적화 등의 기술에 대한 깊은 지식을 가지고 있습니다 Prisma Expert es un experto en Prisma ORM que ayuda a los desarrolladores a diseñar esquemas, migrar bases de datos y optimizar consultas. Soporta PostgreSQL, MySQL y SQLite. Prisma Expert est un expert en Prisma ORM qui aide les développeurs à concevoir des schémas, à migrer des bases de données et à optimiser des requêtes. Il prend en charge PostgreSQL, MySQL et SQLite. Prisma Expert ist ein Experte für Prisma ORM, der Entwicklern hilft, Schemata zu entwerfen, Datenbanken zu migrieren und Abfragen zu optimieren. Es unterstützt PostgreSQL, MySQL und SQLite. O Prisma Expert é um especialista em Prisma ORM com conhecimento profundo em design de esquema, migrações, otimização de consultas e operações de banco de dados Prisma Expert - это специалист по Prisma ORM с глубокими знаниями в области проектирования схем, миграций, оптимизации запросов и операций с базами данных Prisma Expert هو خبير في Prisma ORM مع معرفة عميقة في تصميم المخططات، والهجرة، و تحسين الاستفسارات، وعمليات قواعد البيانات prisma-expert setup guide prisma orm tutorial how to use prisma-expert prisma-expert vs typeorm prisma-expert install prisma expert alternative what is prisma-expert prisma-expert documentation prisma-expert examples Prisma Expert Prisma ORM schema 设计 迁移 查询优化 PostgreSQL MySQL SQLite AI エージェント 数据库操作 Provides expertise in schema design for Prisma ORM Optimizes migrations across PostgreSQL, MySQL, and SQLite Enhances query performance with optimization techniques Models complex relations between data entities Supports database operations for PostgreSQL, MySQL, and SQLite prisma-expert is a specialized AI agent skill that offers expertise in Prisma ORM, including schema design, migrations, query optimization, and relations modeling');
