ces avec une rétroaction","de":"Recap ist eine Fähigkeit von AI Agent, die Gespräche zusammenfasst, um Fähigkeiten mit Feedback zu verbessern","pt":"O Recap é uma habilidade de AI que resume sessões e melhora habilidades com base em feedback","ru":"Recap - это навык ИИ, который суммирует сессии и улучшает навыки на основе обратной связи","ar":"Recap هي مهارة الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تلخص الجلسات وتحسن المهارات بناءً على ملاحظات الجلسة"},"features":{"en":["Auto-invoke capability when all planned steps are done","Supports skipping for Q&A or quick fix conversations","Handles compacted conversations for efficient summarization","Improves skills based on feedback from completed sessions","Integrates with Claude Code for agent skills and workflows"],"zh":["自动总结会话","基于反馈改进技能","支持计划执行完成时的自动调用","Todo 列表完成时的自动调用","处理压缩对话"],"ja":["会話の自動まとめ","フィードバックに基づくスキルの改善","計画の実行が完了したときの自動呼び出し","Todo リストが完了したときの自動呼び出し","圧縮会話の処理"],"ko":["세션 자동 요약","피드백 기반 스킬 개선","계획 실행 완료 시 자동 호출","Todo 목록 완료 시 자동 호출","압축 대화 처리"],"es":["Resumen de conversaciones con Claude Code","Mejora de habilidades con retroalimentación","Autoinvocación cuando una tarea está completa","Compatibilidad con tareas de implementación, análisis y investigación","Manejo de conversaciones compactadas"],"fr":["Résumé de conversations avec Claude Code","Amélioration des compétences avec une rétroaction","Auto-invoke lorsque une tâche est terminée","Compatibilité avec les tâches d''implémentation, d''analyse et de recherche","Gestion de conversations compactées"],"de":["Zusammenfassung von Gesprächen mit Claude Code","Verbesserung von Fähigkeiten mit Feedback","Auto-Aufruf, wenn eine Aufgabe abgeschlossen ist","Kompatibilität mit Implementierungs-, Analyse- und Forschungsaufgaben","Handhabung von komprimierten Gesprächen"],"pt":["Sumarização de sessões com base em feedback","Melhoria de habilidades com Claude Code","Auto-invoke quando uma plano é executado até o fim","Compatibilidade com todo tipo de tarefa de implementação, análise ou pesquisa","Otimização de processos de negócios com AI"],"ru":["Суммирование сессий на основе обратной связи","Улучшение навыков с помощью ИИ Агентов","Автоматическое вызывание при завершении плана","Совместимость со всеми типами задач по реализации, анализу или исследованию","Оптимизация бизнес-процессов с помощью ИИ"],"ar":["تلخيص الجلسات بناءً على ملاحظات الجلسة","تحسين المهارات باستخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","التحويل التلقائي عندما يتم تنفيذ الخطة حتى النهاية","التوافق مع جميع أنواع المهام التطبيقية أو التحليلية أو البحثية","تحسين كفاءة عمليات الأعمال باستخدام الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use recap","recap setup guide","conversation summarization techniques","recap vs other AI agents","recap install for Claude Code","what is recap skill","recap for business operations","auto-invoke recap","recap feedback mechanism"],"zh":["Recap 技术","AI 工作空间","会话总结","技能改进","Claude Code","自动调用","Todo 列表","压缩对话"],"ja":["Recap 技術","AI ワークスペース","会話のまとめ","スキルの改善","Claude Code","自動呼び出し","Todo リスト","圧縮会話"],"ko":["Recap 기술","AI 작업 공간","세션 요약","스킬 개선","Claude Code","자동 호출","Todo 목록","압축 대화"],"es":["Recap AI Agent","Herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","Resumen de conversaciones","Mejora de habilidades con retroalimentación","Claude Code","Desarrollo de habilidades de AI","Tecnologías de AI para negocios"],"fr":["Recap AI Agent","Outils d''AI pour les développeurs","Résumé de conversations","Amélioration des compétences avec une rétroaction","Claude Code","Développement de compétences d''AI","Technologies d''AI pour les entreprises"],"de":["Recap AI Agent","AI-Tools für Entwickler","Zusammenfassung von Gesprächen","Verbesserung von Fähigkeiten mit Feedback","Claude Code","Entwicklung von AI-Fähigkeiten","AI-Technologien für Unternehmen"],"pt":["Recap","AI para negócios","Claude Code","sumarização de sessões","melhoria de habilidades","auto-invoke","processos de negócios","otimização de processos"],"ru":["Recap","ИИ для бизнеса","ИИ Агенты","суммирование сессий","улучшение навыков","автоматическое вызывание","бизнес-процессы","оптимизация процессов"],"ar":["Recap","الذكاء الاصطناعي للأعمال","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تلخيص الجلسات","تحسين المهارات","التحويل التلقائي","عمليات الأعمال","تحسين كفاءة العمليات"]}},"owner":"gnestor","repo":"claude-workflow-plugin","repoPath":"gnestor/claude-workflow-plugin","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-22T18:41:03Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"recap","description":">","bodyPreview":"# Conversation Recap\n\nSummarize the session and improve skills based on feedback from the session.\n\n## When to Use\n\n**Auto-invoke this skill when:**\n- A plan has been executed to completion (all planned steps done)\n- All todos in the todo list are marked complete\n- A significant implementation, analysis, or research task is finished\n\n**Skip** if the conversation was just Q&A, quick fixes, or no lasting learnings.\n\n## Process\n\n### Step 0: Handle Compacted Conversations\n\nIf the conversation has be","body":"# Conversation Recap\n\nSummarize the session and improve skills based on feedback from the session.\n\n## When to Use\n\n**Auto-invoke this skill when:**\n- A plan has been executed to completion (all planned steps done)\n- All todos in the todo list are marked complete\n- A significant implementation, analysis, or research task is finished\n\n**Skip** if the conversation was just Q&A, quick fixes, or no lasting learnings.\n\n## Process\n\n### Step 0: Handle Compacted Conversations\n\nIf the conversation has been compacted (you see a summary at the start mentioning \"continued from a previous conversation\"), fetch the full conversation logs.\n\n**Log location:** `~/.claude/projects/` (find the directory matching this workspace path)\n\n```bash\n# List project directories to find the right one\nls -d ~/.claude/projects/*/\n\n# List recent conversation logs by size (larger = more content)\nls -laS ~/.claude/projects/<project-dir>/*.jsonl | head -10\n\n# Extract user prompts from a conversation log\ncat ~/.claude/projects/<project-dir>/<conversation-id>.jsonl | jq -c ''select(.type == \"user\") | .message.content[0].text'' 2>/dev/null | grep -v \"^null$\" | head -30\n```\n\n**Log entry types:** `user` (prompts), `assistant` (responses), `summary` (compaction), `progress` (tools), `system`\n\n### Step 1: Analyze the Conversation\n\nReview the conversation (and logs if compacted) to identify:\n1. **Initial prompt**: The user''s original request\n2. **Plan**: The approved approach/plan\n3. **Execution**: What was done, step by step\n4. **Result**: Final outcome, deliverables, findings\n5. **Errors/failures**: Problems encountered and how they were solved\n6. **Usage patterns**: New skill usage patterns discovered\n7. **Company context**: New insights about the business\n\n### Step 2: Create Session Summary\n\nSave to: `workflows/yyyy-mm-dd-hh-mm-ss-workflow-title.md`\n\nUse the template from [references/templates.md](references/templates.md#session-summary-template).\n\n**Filename guidelines:**\n- Format: `yyyy-mm-dd-hh-mm-ss-descriptive-title.md`\n- Use lowercase with hyphens\n- Be descriptive but concise\n- Examples: `2026-01-25-14-30-00-email-revenue-analysis.md`\n\n### Step 3: Improve Skills\n\nReview the session for learnings that should be integrated into skills:\n\n| Finding Type | Action | Location |\n|--------------|--------|----------|\n| Error/failure with solution | Add fix to skill''s script or SKILL.md | `.claude/skills/<skill>/` |\n| New usage pattern | Document in references | `.claude/skills/<skill>/references/` |\n| New company context | Add to relevant department file | `.claude/skills/company/references/` |\n\n**Department files:** overview, team, goals, products, marketing, finance, operations, customer-service\n\n**Important:** Ensure all skill revisions comply with skill-creator guidelines:\n- SKILL.md must stay under 500 lines\n- Split content into reference files when approaching this limit\n- Reference files from SKILL.md with clear descriptions of when to read them\n\n### Step 4: Summarize Changes\n\nAfter documenting and updating, provide the user with:\n1. Path to the session summary file\n2. List of skill files that were updated\n3. Brief summary of what was captured\n\n## Guidelines\n\n### What to Include in Session Summary\n\n- **Title with date**: Descriptive title with date underneath\n- **Initial prompt**: Exact user request (quoted)\n- **Plan**: The approved approach\n- **Execution summary**: Step-by-step what was done\n- **Result**: Findings, deliverables, conclusions\n- **Appendix**: List of all skill revisions made\n\n### What to Add to Skills\n\n**For errors/failures:**\n- Add solution to SKILL.md troubleshooting section, or\n- Fix the script directly in `scripts/`\n\n**For usage patterns:**\n- Add to `references/workflow-examples.md` with example prompts and steps\n\n**For company context:**\n- Add to the relevant department file in `.claude/skills/company/references/`\n\n## Don''t\n\n- Create documentation for trivial conversations\n- Duplicate information across multiple files\n- Add verbose explanations - keep it concise\n- Exceed 500 lines in any SKILL.md file\n- Create files in `.claude/plans/` (plans are temporary)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T03:39:29.919Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Workflow Automation Agents like Claude Code, needing session summarization and skill improvement capabilities.","zh":"适用于Claude Code等工作流自动化代理，需要会议总结和技能改进能力的代理。","ja":"Claude Codeのようなワークフロー自動化エージェントに適しており、セッションの要約とスキル改善の機能が必要です。","ko":"클라우드 코드와 같은 워크플로 자동화 에이전트에 적합하며, 세션 요약 및 기술 개선 기능이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Automatización de Flujo de Trabajo como Claude Code, que necesitan capacidades de resumen de sesión y mejora de habilidades.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation de workflow comme Claude Code, nécessitant des capacités de résumé de session et d''amélioration des compétences.","de":"Ideal für Workflow-Automatisierungsagenten wie Claude Code, die Sitzungszusammenfassung und Fähigkeitsverbesserungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação de Fluxo de Trabalho como Claude Code, que necessitam de capacidades de resumo de sessão e melhoria de habilidades.","ru":"Идеально для агентов автоматизации рабочих процессов, таких как Claude Code, которым необходимы возможности суммирования сессий и улучшения навыков.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تلقيمي لاعتمادات سير العمل مثل Claude Code ، الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات تلخيص الجلسة وتحسين المهارات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to summarize sessions, improve skills based on feedback, and optimize workflows using conversation analysis and todo list management, leveraging protocols like Auto-invoke and integration with todo lists.","zh":"赋予代理总结会议、根据反馈改进技能并使用对话分析和待办事项列表管理优化工作流的能力，利用Auto-invoke等协议和与待办事项列表的集成。","ja":"エージェントに会話分析とTODOリスト管理を利用してセッションを要約し、フィードバックに基づいてスキルを改善し、ワークフローを最適化する能力を与え、Auto-invokeなどのプロトコルとTODOリストとの統合を利用する。","ko":"에이전트가 세션을 요약하고, 피드백을 기반으로 기술을 개선하며, 대화 분석 및 할 일 목록 관리를 사용하여 워크플로우를 최적화 할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, Auto-invoke 등의 프로토콜 및 할 일 목록과 통합을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a resumir sesiones, mejorar habilidades en función de la retroalimentación y optimizar flujos de trabajo utilizando análisis de conversación y administración de listas de tareas, aprovechando protocolos como Auto-invoke y la integración con listas de tareas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de résumer les sessions, d''améliorer les compétences en fonction des commentaires et d''optimiser les flux de travail en utilisant l''analyse de conversation et la gestion des listes de tâches, en exploitant des protocoles tels que Auto-invoke et l''intégration avec les listes de tâches.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Sitzungen zusammenzufassen, Fähigkeiten auf der Grundlage von Feedback zu verbessern und Workflows mithilfe der Konversationsanalyse und der Verwaltung von Todo-Listen zu optimieren, indem Protokolle wie Auto-invoke und die Integration mit Todo-Listen genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a resumir sessões, melhorar habilidades com base no feedback e otimizar fluxos de trabalho usando análise de conversa e gerenciamento de lista de tarefas, aproveitando protocolos como Auto-invoke e integração com listas de tarefas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью суммировать сессии, улучшать навыки на основе обратной связи и оптимизировать рабочие процессы с помощью анализа разговоров и управления списком дел, используя протоколы, такие как Auto-invoke, и интеграцию со списками дел.","ar":"يتمكن العملاء من تلخيص الجلسات وتحسين المهارات بناءً على ملاحظات وتحسين سير العمل باستخدام تحليل المحادثة وإدارة قائمة المهام ، واستخدام بروتوكولات مثل Auto-invoke والتكامل مع قوائم المهام."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating session recaps after task completion","Improving agent skills through feedback analysis","Enhancing workflow efficiency by summarizing significant implementation tasks"],"zh":["任务完成后自动总结会议","通过反馈分析改进代理技能","通过总结重要的实施任务来提高工作流效率"],"ja":["タスク完了後にセッションを自動的に要約する","フィードバック分析を通じてエージェントのスキルを改善する","重要な実装タスクを要約してワークフロー効率を向上させる"],"ko":["작업 완료 후 세션을 자동으로 요약하는 것","피드백 분석을 통해 에이전트의 기술을 개선하는 것","중요한 구현 작업을 요약하여 워크플로우 효율성을 높이는 것"],"es":["Automatizar los resúmenes de sesión después de la finalización de tareas","Mejorar las habilidades de los agentes a través del análisis de comentarios","Mejorar la eficiencia del flujo de trabajo resumiendo tareas de implementación significativas"],"fr":["Automatiser les résumés de session après l''achèvement des tâches","Améliorer les compétences des agents grâce à l''analyse des commentaires","Améliorer l''efficacité du flux de travail en résumant les tâches d''implémentation importantes"],"de":["Sitzungszusammenfassungen nach der Aufgabenabwicklung automatisieren","Agentenfähigkeiten durch Feedback-Analyse verbessern","Workflow-Effizienz durch Zusammenfassung bedeutender Implementierungsaufgaben verbessern"],"pt":["Automatizar resumos de sessão após conclusão de tarefas","Melhorar habilidades de agentes por meio de análise de feedback","Aumentar a eficiência do fluxo de trabalho resumindo tarefas de implementação significativas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать сводки сессий после завершения задач","Улучшать навыки агентов посредством анализа обратной связи","Повышать эффективность рабочих процессов, суммируя значимые задачи реализации"],"ar":["تلقيم تلخيص الجلسات بعد إكمال المهام","تحسين مهارات العملاء من خلال تحليل الملاحظات","تعزيز كفاءة سير العمل عن طريق تلخيص المهام الهامة للتطبيق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires completed plans or todo lists","Skips conversations with no lasting learnings or quick fixes"],"zh":["需要完成的计划或待办事项列表","跳过没有持久学习或快速修复的对话"],"ja":["完了した計画またはTODOリストが必要","持続的な学習や迅速な修正がない会話をスキップする"],"ko":["완료된 계획 또는 할 일 목록이 필요","지속적인 학습이나 빠른 수정이 없는 대화를 건너뛴다"],"es":["Requiere planes o listas de tareas completados","Omite conversaciones sin aprendizajes duraderos o soluciones rápidas"],"fr":["Nécessite des plans ou des listes de tâches complets","Ignore les conversations sans apprentissages durables ou solutions rapides"],"de":["Benötigt abgeschlossene Pläne oder Todo-Listen","Überspringt Gespräche ohne dauerhafte Lernergebnisse oder schnelle Lösungen"],"pt":["Requer planos ou listas de tarefas concluídos","Ignora conversas sem aprendizados duradouros ou soluções rápidas"],"ru":["Требует завершенных планов или списков дел","Игнорирует разговоры без долгосрочных знаний или быстрых решений"],"ar":["يتطلب خططا أو قوائم مهام مكتملة","يتجاهل المحادثات دون معرفة دائمة أو حلول سريعة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"01cfe294f1dfc87cdbe3d2e8a0b3f997f0b28d287a82dba1eae495916d50b105","qualityScore":54}');
