zur Ausführung von Befehlen im Backend","Unterstützung für die Ausführung von Befehlen im Backend-Verzeichnis"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de bancos de dados PostgreSQL com Prisma","Execução de comandos no backend com Docker","Criação de migrações de dados com Prisma","Deploy de migrações de dados com Prisma","Gerenciamento de migrações de dados em desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Управление базами данных PostgreSQL с помощью Prisma","Выполнение команд в backend с помощью Docker","Создание миграций данных с помощью Prisma","Развертывание миграций данных с помощью Prisma","Управление миграциями данных в процессе разработки"],"ar":["إدارة قواعد بيانات PostgreSQL باستخدام Prisma","تنفيذ أوامر في الخلفية باستخدام Docker","إنشاء هجرات البيانات باستخدام Prisma","نشر هجرات البيانات باستخدام Prisma","إدارة هجرات البيانات أثناء التطوير"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use db","db setup guide","PostgreSQL database management","Prisma tutorial","db vs Prisma","db install","what is db","db alternative","db documentation"],"zh":["db 技术","PostgreSQL 数据库管理","Prisma","迁移和部署","Docker","数据库操作","AI エージェント","AI 技术"],"ja":["db 技術","PostgreSQL データベース管理","Prisma","移行とデプロイ","Docker","データベース操作","AI エージェント","AI ツール"],"ko":["db 설정","PostgreSQL 데이터베이스 관리","Prisma","마이그레이션 및 배포","Docker","데이터베이스 작업","AI 에이전트","AI 도구"],"es":["db skill","gestión de bases de datos","Prisma","PostgreSQL","migraciones","desarrollo de aplicaciones","Real Estate","herramientas de desarrollo","bases de datos en la nube"],"fr":["skill db","gestion de bases de données","Prisma","PostgreSQL","migrations","développement d''applications","immobilier","outils de développement","bases de données en ligne"],"de":["db-Skill","Datenbank-Verwaltung","Prisma","PostgreSQL","Migrationen","Anwendungs-Entwicklung","Immobilien","Entwicklungs-Tools","Datenbanken in der Cloud"],"pt":["db skill","gerenciamento de banco de dados","PostgreSQL","Prisma","Docker","migração de dados","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты db","управление базами данных","PostgreSQL","Prisma","Docker","миграция данных","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["أداة db","إدارة قواعد البيانات","PostgreSQL","Prisma","Docker","هجرة البيانات","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"pinoshe","repo":"real-estate-app","repoPath":"pinoshe/real-estate-app","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-05T20:16:57Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"db","description":"Database operations - run migrations, seed data, open Prisma Studio, reset, or inspect schema. Use when the user needs to work with the database.","bodyPreview":"# Database Operations\n\nManage the PostgreSQL database via Prisma. All commands target the backend at `C:/Users/pi/projects/rea/main/backend`.\n\nParse `$ARGUMENTS` for the action.\n\n## Actions\n\n### `migrate` (default)\nRun pending migrations against the local database.\n```bash\ndocker exec rea-backend sh -c \"cd /home/site/wwwroot && npx prisma migrate deploy\"\n```\n\n### `migrate:dev`\nCreate a new migration during development.\n```bash\ndocker exec rea-backend sh -c \"cd /home/site/wwwroot && npx prisma mi","body":"# Database Operations\n\nManage the PostgreSQL database via Prisma. All commands target the backend at `C:/Users/pi/projects/rea/main/backend`.\n\nParse `$ARGUMENTS` for the action.\n\n## Actions\n\n### `migrate` (default)\nRun pending migrations against the local database.\n```bash\ndocker exec rea-backend sh -c \"cd /home/site/wwwroot && npx prisma migrate deploy\"\n```\n\n### `migrate:dev`\nCreate a new migration during development.\n```bash\ndocker exec rea-backend sh -c \"cd /home/site/wwwroot && npx prisma migrate dev --name $ARGUMENTS[1]\"\n```\nRequires a migration name as the second argument.\n\n### `seed`\nSeed the database with test data.\n```bash\ndocker exec rea-backend sh -c \"cd /home/site/wwwroot && npm run db:seed\"\n```\n\n### `reset`\nReset the database (drops all data, re-runs migrations and seed). **Confirm with user before running.**\n```bash\ndocker exec rea-backend sh -c \"cd /home/site/wwwroot && npx prisma migrate reset --force\"\n```\n\n### `studio`\nOpen Prisma Studio for visual database browsing.\n```bash\ndocker exec rea-backend sh -c \"cd /home/site/wwwroot && npx prisma studio\"\n```\nNote: Prisma Studio runs on port 5555 inside the container. The user may need to map this port.\n\n### `schema`\nDisplay the current Prisma schema.\nRead the file: `C:/Users/pi/projects/rea/main/backend/prisma/schema.prisma`\n\n### `generate`\nRegenerate the Prisma client after schema changes.\n```bash\ndocker exec rea-backend sh -c \"cd /home/site/wwwroot && npx prisma generate\"\n```\n\n### `status`\nShow migration status.\n```bash\ndocker exec rea-backend sh -c \"cd /home/site/wwwroot && npx prisma migrate status\"\n```\n\n## Notes\n- The database container must be running (`docker-compose up -d db`)\n- Connection string: `postgresql://dev:dev@db:5432/realestate` (inside Docker network)\n- Adminer UI available at http://localhost:8080 (server: `db`, user: `dev`, pass: `dev`, db: `realestate`)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T03:51:20.751Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Backend Agents working with real estate applications needing streamlined PostgreSQL database management via Prisma.","zh":"非常适合与需要通过Prisma简化PostgreSQL数据库管理的房地产应用程序合作的后端代理。","ja":"Prismaを使用してPostgreSQLデータベースを管理する必要があるリアルエステートアプリケーションとのバックエンドエージェントの作業に最適です。","ko":"Prisma를 통해 PostgreSQL 데이터베이스 관리를 간소화해야 하는 부동산 애플리케이션과 함께 작업하는 백엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Backend que trabajan con aplicaciones de bienes raíces que necesitan una gestión de base de datos PostgreSQL optimizada a través de Prisma.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Backend travaillant avec des applications immobilières nécessitant une gestion de base de données PostgreSQL rationalisée via Prisma.","de":"Perfekt für Backend-Agents, die mit Immobilienanwendungen arbeiten, die eine optimierte PostgreSQL-Datenbankverwaltung über Prisma benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes Backend que trabalham com aplicações de imóveis que necessitam de gerenciamento de banco de dados PostgreSQL otimizado via Prisma.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Backend, работающих с приложениями недвижимости, требующими оптимизированного управления базой данных PostgreSQL через Prisma.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الخلفية الذين يعملون مع تطبيقات العقارات التي تحتاج إلى إدارة قاعدة بيانات PostgreSQL المُتدفقة عبر Prisma."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage PostgreSQL databases via Prisma, facilitating actions like migration deployment and development using commands like `npx prisma migrate deploy` and `npx prisma mi`.","zh":"赋予代理管理PostgreSQL数据库的能力，通过命令如`npx prisma migrate deploy`和`npx prisma mi`，促进诸如迁移部署和开发等操作。","ja":"エージェントがPostgreSQLデータベースを管理できるようにし、`npx prisma migrate deploy`や`npx prisma mi`などのコマンドを使用して、マイグレーションの展開や開発などのアクションを促進します。","ko":"에이전트가 PostgreSQL 데이터베이스를 관리할 수 있도록 하며, `npx prisma migrate deploy` 및 `npx prisma mi`와 같은 명령을 사용하여 마이그레이션 배포 및 개발과 같은 작업을促進합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar bases de datos PostgreSQL a través de Prisma, facilitando acciones como la implementación de migraciones y el desarrollo utilizando comandos como `npx prisma migrate deploy` y `npx prisma mi`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les bases de données PostgreSQL via Prisma, facilitant des actions comme le déploiement de migrations et le développement en utilisant des commandes comme `npx prisma migrate deploy` et `npx prisma mi`.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, PostgreSQL-Datenbanken über Prisma zu verwalten, wodurch Aktionen wie Migration-Deployment und Entwicklung mithilfe von Befehlen wie `npx prisma migrate deploy` und `npx prisma mi` erleichtert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar bancos de dados PostgreSQL via Prisma, facilitando ações como implantação de migração e desenvolvimento usando comandos como `npx prisma migrate deploy` e `npx prisma mi`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять базами данных PostgreSQL через Prisma, облегчая действия, такие как развертывание миграции и разработка с помощью команд, таких как `npx prisma migrate deploy` и `npx prisma mi`.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة قواعد بيانات PostgreSQL عبر Prisma، ويسهم في تسهيل الإجراءات مثل نشر الترحيل وتطوير باستخدام أوامر مثل `npx prisma migrate deploy` و `npx prisma mi`."},"useCases":{"en":["Deploying pending migrations against the local database","Creating new migrations during development","Managing database schema using Prisma"],"zh":["将待处理的迁移部署到本地数据库","在开发过程中创建新的迁移","使用Prisma管理数据库模式"],"ja":["ローカルデータベースに対して保留中のマイグレーションを展開する","開発中に新しいマイグレーションを作成する","Prismaを使用してデータベーススキーマを管理する"],"ko":["로컬 데이터베이스에 대기 중인 마이그레이션을 배포하는 것","개발 중에 새로운 마이그레이션을 생성하는 것","Prisma를 사용하여 데이터베이스 스키마를 관리하는 것"],"es":["Implementar migraciones pendientes en la base de datos local","Crear nuevas migraciones durante el desarrollo","Gestionar el esquema de base de datos utilizando Prisma"],"fr":["Déployer des migrations en attente contre la base de données locale","Créer de nouvelles migrations pendant le développement","Gérer le schéma de base de données à l''aide de Prisma"],"de":["Pendente Migrationen gegen die lokale Datenbank bereitstellen","Während der Entwicklung neue Migrationen erstellen","Datenbank-Schema mithilfe von Prisma verwalten"],"pt":["Implantação de migrações pendentes contra o banco de dados local","Criação de novas migrações durante o desenvolvimento","Gerenciamento do esquema de banco de dados usando Prisma"],"ru":["Развертывание ожидающих миграций против локальной базы данных","Создание новых миграций во время разработки","Управление схемой базы данных с помощью Prisma"],"ar":["نشر الترحيلات المعلقة على قاعدة البيانات المحلية","إنشاء ترحيلات جديدة أثناء التطوير","إدارة مخطط قاعدة البيانات باستخدام Prisma"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Prisma installation","Targets backend at specific directory C:/Users/pi/projects/rea/main/backend","PostgreSQL database only"],"zh":