e für Architektur-Design","Technologien für Architektur-Design"],"pt":["tech stack skill","arquitetura de design","tecnologias aprovadas","exceções formais","solution intent","markdown","desenvolvimento de software","ai agents","ferramentas de ai"],"ru":["tech stack skill","архитектура дизайна","утвержденные технологии","формальные исключения","solution intent","markdown","разработка программного обеспечения","ии агенты","инструменты ии"],"ar":["مهارة tech stack","تصميم معماري","تقنيات معتمدة","استثناءات رسمية","solution intent","markdown","تطوير البرمجيات","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"dacy","repo":"architect-skill","repoPath":"dacy/architect-skill","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T07:20:36Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tech-stack-skill","description":"Use this skill for technology selection decisions. Trigger on tech stack, technology selection, what language, what framework, approved technologies, tech exception, or any time a technology choice is being made. The company has an opinionated tech stack — always consult this skill before recommending a technology to ensure alignment with approved choices.","bodyPreview":"# Tech Stack Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill guides technology selection aligned to the company''s opinionated tech stack.\nThe stack defines approved technologies by layer — anything outside the approved list\nrequires a formal exception before it can be used.\n\nRead `references/tech-stack.md` for the full approved technology catalog, tier definitions,\nand exception process before making any technology recommendation.\n\n---\n\n## Output\n\n- **Markdown (.md)** — Tech Stack section for Solution Intent, or","body":"# Tech Stack Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill guides technology selection aligned to the company''s opinionated tech stack.\nThe stack defines approved technologies by layer — anything outside the approved list\nrequires a formal exception before it can be used.\n\nRead `references/tech-stack.md` for the full approved technology catalog, tier definitions,\nand exception process before making any technology recommendation.\n\n---\n\n## Output\n\n- **Markdown (.md)** — Tech Stack section for Solution Intent, or standalone analysis\n- Name file: `[initiative-name]-tech-stack.md`\n\n---\n\n## Approval Tiers\n\nTechnologies fall into one of three tiers (see `references/tech-stack.md` for the full list):\n\n| Tier | Meaning |\n|------|---------|\n| **Approved** | Standard choice — use without additional review |\n| **Conditionally Approved** | Approved for specific use cases only — confirm fit |\n| **Exception Required** | Not on the approved list — requires architecture board review |\n\n---\n\n## Process\n\n### Step 1: Identify technology decisions needed\n\nFrom the requirement, list every technology choice that must be made:\n- Runtime language and version\n- Application framework\n- API style (REST, gRPC, GraphQL)\n- Messaging / eventing platform\n- Database(s)\n- Caching\n- UI framework (if applicable)\n- Infrastructure / compute\n- CI/CD tooling\n- Observability stack\n\n### Step 2: Match to approved stack\n\nFor each decision, look up the approved choice in `references/tech-stack.md` and document:\n\n| Layer | Decision | Approved Choice | Tier | Notes |\n|-------|----------|----------------|------|-------|\n| Runtime | Language | [approved] | Approved | |\n| Framework | API | [approved] | Approved | |\n| Messaging | Events | [approved] | Approved | |\n| ... | ... | ... | ... | |\n\n### Step 3: Flag exceptions\n\nFor any technology not in the approved catalog:\n1. Document the proposed technology and the reason the approved alternative doesn''t fit\n2. Identify the exception type (new technology, unsupported version, non-standard pattern)\n3. Outline the exception approval path (see `references/tech-stack.md` — Exception Process)\n4. Mark as ⚠️ in the tech stack table — no exceptions proceed without approval\n\n### Step 4: Version alignment\n\nEnsure proposed versions align with company-supported versions. Flag any end-of-life or\nunsupported versions as risks.\n\n---\n\n## Document Structure\n\n```\n# [Initiative Name] — Tech Stack\n\n## Technology Decisions\n\n| Layer | Choice | Tier | Justification |\n|-------|--------|------|---------------|\n| [Layer] | [Technology v.x] | Approved / Conditional / Exception | [Why] |\n\n## Exception Requests\n[Technology | Reason approved option doesn''t fit | Approval path]\n\n## Version Risk Register\n[Any EOL or unsupported version flags]\n\n## Open Questions\n```\n\n---\n\n## Reference Files\n\n- `references/tech-stack.md` — Company approved technology catalog by layer, tier\n  classifications, conditionally approved use cases, and exception process.\n  **TODO:** Populate with your organization''s opinionated tech stack.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T04:06:30.876Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Architecture Agents needing standardized technology selection aligned to company-approved tech stacks.","zh":"适用于需要标准化技术选择并与公司批准的技术栈对齐的架构代理。","ja":"企業が承認したテクノロジースタックに合わせて標準化されたテクノロジ選択が必要なアーキテクチャエージェントに最適。","ko":"기업에서 승인한 기술 스택에 맞춰 표준화된 기술 선택이 필요한 아키텍처 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Arquitectura que necesitan una selección de tecnología estandarizada alineada con las pilas de tecnología aprobadas por la empresa.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''architecture ayant besoin d''une sélection de technologie standardisée alignée sur les piles de technologie approuvées par l''entreprise.","de":"Ideal für Architektur-Agenten, die eine standardisierte Technologieauswahl benötigen, die an die von der Firma genehmigten Technologie-Stacks ausgerichtet ist.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Arquitetura que necessitam de seleção de tecnologia padronizada alinhada às pilhas de tecnologia aprovadas pela empresa.","ru":"Идеально для агентов архитектуры, которым необходима стандартизированная выбор технологий, соответствующая одобренным технологическим стекам компании.","ar":"مثالي لعميلات الهندسة المعمارية التي تحتاج إلى اختيار تقنيات معياري متوافق مع مجموعات التقنيات المعتمدة من الشركة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to guide technology selection by layer, utilizing approved technologies and formal exception processes, while referencing comprehensive content analysis from markdown files like ''tech-stack.md'' for tier definitions and cataloging.","zh":"赋予代理引导技术选择的能力，通过分层利用批准的技术和正式的异常处理过程，同时参考从markdown文件（如''tech-stack.md''）中获得的综合内容分析，以进行分级定义和编目。","ja":"エージェントがレイヤーごとに技術選択を導き、承認されたテクノロジーを利用し、正式な例外処理プロセスを参考しながら、''tech-stack.md''のようなマークダウンファイルからの包括的なコンテンツ分析を参照して、階層定義とカタログ化を行うことを可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 기술 선택을 가이드할 수 있도록 하며, 계층별로 승인된 기술을 사용하고 공식 예외 처리 프로세스를 통해 마크다운 파일(''tech-stack.md''와 같은)에서 수행한 포괄적인 콘텐츠 분석을 참조하여 티어 정의 및 카탈로그화를 수행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes guiar la selección de tecnología por capa, utilizando tecnologías aprobadas y procesos de excepción formales, mientras se hace referencia a un análisis de contenido integral de archivos markdown como ''tech-stack.md'' para definiciones de niveles y catalogación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de guider la sélection de technologie par couche, en utilisant des technologies approuvées et des processus de dérogation formels, tout en référençant une analyse de contenu complète de fichiers markdown tels que ''tech-stack.md'' pour les définitions de niveaux et la catalogation.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Technologieauswahl schichtweise zu leiten, indem sie genehmigte Technologien und formale Ausnahmeverfahren verwenden, während sie auf eine umfassende Inhaltsanalyse von Markdown-Dateien wie ''tech-stack.md'' für Tier-Definitionen und Katalogisierung verweisen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a orientar a seleção de tecnologia por camada, utilizando tecnologias aprovadas e processos formais de exceção, enquanto faz referência a uma análise abrangente de conteúdo de arquivos markdown como ''tech-stack.md'' para definições de nível e catalogação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью руководить выбором технологий по слоям, используя одобренные технологии и формальные процессы исключения, при этом ссылаясь на всесторонний анализ содержания файлов markdown, таких как ''tech-stack.md'', для определений уровней и каталогизации.","ar":"تمكّن العميلات من توجيه اختيار التكنولوجيا حسب الطبقات، باستخدام تقنيات معتمدة ومنهجية استثناء رسمية، في حين الإشارة إلى تحليل شامل للمحتوى من ملفات ملحوظة مثل ''tech-stack.md'' لتعريفات المستويات والفهرسة."},"useCases":{"en":["Standardizing technology choices across projects","Creating architecture design frameworks","Validating technology selections against approved catalogs"],"zh":["在项目中标准化技术选择","创建架构设计框架","验证技术选择是否与批准的目录相符"],"ja":["プロジェクト間でテクノロジー選択を標準化する","アーキテクチャ設計フレームワークを作成する","テクノロジー選択が承認されたカタログと一致することを検証する"],"ko":["프로젝트에서 기술 선택을 표준화하는 것","아키텍처 설계 프레임워크를 만드는 것","기술 선택이 승인된 카탈로그와 일치하는지 검증하는 것"],"es":["Estandarizar las opciones de tecnología en todos los proyectos","Crear marcos de diseño de arquitectura","Validar las selecciones de tecnología frente a catálogos aprobados"],"fr":["Standardiser les choix de technologie à travers les projets","Créer des cadres de conception d''architecture","Valider les sélections de technologie par rapport aux catalogues approuvés"],"de":["Die Technologieoptionen in allen Projekten standardisieren","Architektur-Design-Frameworks erstellen","Die Technologieauswahlen gegenüber den genehmigten Katalogen validieren"],"pt":["Padronizar escolhas de tecnologia em todo o projeto","Criar estruturas de design de arquitetura","Validar seleções de tecnologia contra catálogos aprovados"],"ru":["Стандартизировать выбор технологий во всех проектах","Создавать фреймворки проектирования архитектуры","Проверять выбор технологий против одобренных каталогов"],"ar":["معيارية اختيار التقنيات في جميع المشاريع","إنشاء إطارات تصميم هندسي","التحقق من اختيار التقنيات مقابل الفهارس المعتمدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to company-approved tech stack documentation","Needs formal exception process for non-approved technologies"],"zh":["需要访问公司批准的技术栈文档","需要正式的异常处理过程来处理未批准的技术"],"ja":["企業が承認したテクノロジースタックのドキュメントへのアクセスが必要","承認されていないテクノロジーに対する正式な例外処理プロセスが必要"],"ko":["기업에서 승인한 기술 스택 문서에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다.","승인되지 않은 기술에 대한 공식 예외 처리 프로세스가 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere acceso a la documentación de la pila de tecnología aprobada por la empresa","Necesita un proceso de excepción formal para tecnologías no aprobadas"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la documentation de la pile de technologie approuvée par l''entreprise","A besoin d''un processus de dérogation formel pour les technologies non approuvées"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Dokumentation des von der Firma genehmigten Technologie-Stacks","Benötigt ein formales Ausnahmeverfahren für nicht genehmigte Technologien"],"pt":["Exige acesso à documentação da pilha de tecnologia aprovada pela empresa","Necessita de um processo formal de exceção para tecnologias não aprovadas"],"ru":["Требует доступа к документации одобренного технологического стека компании","Требует формального процесса исключения для неодобренных технологий"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى وثائق مجموعة التقنيات المعتمدة من الشركة","يحتاج إلى عملية استثناء رسمية للتقنيات غير المعتمدة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"26c105dfd134b6ba6e952cb83cb73c5368d66e8319d75724b46fc484f7018e30","qualityScore":54}');
