INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('c4kar/Kukufi/m365-agents-dotnet', 'm365-agents-dotnet', 'c4kar', 'Kukufi', 'community', 'm365-agents-dotnet c4kar Kukufi community The m365-agents-dotnet skill enables developers to build enterprise agents for Microsoft 365, Teams, and Copilot Studio using the Microsoft.Agents SDK. It benefits developers looking to integrate AI agents with Microsoft services. m365-agents-dotnet SDK 提供了使用 ASP.NET Core 搭建企业级 AI 代理的能力，实现与 Microsoft 365 和 Teams 的无缝集成 m365-agents-dotnet SDK は、ASP.NET Core を使用した企業向け AI エージェントの構築と Microsoft 365、Teams との統合を実現します m365-agents-dotnet SDK는 ASP.NET Core를 사용하여 엔터프라이즈급 AI 에이전트를 구축하고 Microsoft 365 및 Teams와 통합할 수 있습니다 El SDK de Microsoft.Agents para .NET permite crear agentes empresariales para Microsoft 365, Teams y Copilot Studio con ASP.NET Core Le SDK Microsoft.Agents pour .NET permet de créer des agents d''entreprise pour Microsoft 365, Teams et Copilot Studio avec ASP.NET Core Das Microsoft.Agents-SDK für .NET ermöglicht die Erstellung von Unternehmensagenten für Microsoft 365, Teams und Copilot Studio mit ASP.NET Core O m365-agents-dotnet permite o desenvolvimento de agentes empresariais para Microsoft 365, Teams e Copilot Studio com ASP.NET Core e autenticação MSAL ИИ Агенты m365-agents-dotnet позволяет разработать предприятские агенты для Microsoft 365, Teams и Copilot Studio с помощью ASP.NET Core и аутентификации MSAL م365-وكلاء-dotnet يتيح تطوير وكلاء مؤسسية لمنصة Microsoft 365 و Teams و Copilot Studio باستخدام ASP.NET Core و مصادقة MSAL how to use m365-agents-dotnet what is m365-agents-dotnet m365-agents-dotnet alternative m365-agents-dotnet vs Microsoft.Bot.Framework m365-agents-dotnet install m365-agents-dotnet setup guide m365-agents-dotnet asp.net core m365-agents-dotnet msal authentication m365-agents-dotnet nuget packages m365-agents-dotnet ASP.NET Core AI 代理 Microsoft 365 Teams MSAL 认证 agent 路由 AddAgent API Builds enterprise agents for Microsoft 365, Teams, and Copilot Studio using the Microsoft.Agents SDK Utilizes ASP.NET Core hosting for scalable and secure agent deployment Supports MSAL-based authentication for secure agent authorization Provides agent routing for efficient communication between agents and services Requires verification of latest APIs using the microsoft-docs MCP Depends on specific package versions in NuGet for the Microsoft.Agents.* packages m365-agents-dotnet is a .NET-based SDK for building enterprise agents with ASP.NET Core hosting, agent routing, and MSAL-based authentication for Microsoft 365, Teams, and Copilot Studio.');
